(799025, 89231, 772, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t normally comment on a photo like this one but I can''t help myself.  I would certainly hope that a photo of a digital camera used for advertising a digital camera would be a nice crisp and clean photograph.  I''m probably missing your artistic point with this shot, but I would certainly hope that the point is not to advertise digital imaging.</td>', 'I wouldn''t normally comment on a photo like this one but I can''t help myself.  I would certainly hope that a photo of a digital camera used for advertising a digital camera would be a nice crisp and clean photograph.  I''m probably missing your artistic point with this shot, but I would certainly hope that the point is not to advertise digital imaging.', '2004-07-07 01:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(799026, 89238, 22967, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the pole/handrail at the top is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Great shot, the pole/handrail at the top is a bit distracting though.', '2004-07-07 01:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
