(799069, 89167, 7252, '<td valign="top">I think the watch is turned a little too much to the side. I don''t know how much diffusion you used on your light source but I would recommend more to bring the harsh highlights under control. A different colored background would also be nice. the current one is too close in color to the watch face making for a very monochromatic  feeling presentation.</td>', 'I think the watch is turned a little too much to the side. I don''t know how much diffusion you used on your light source but I would recommend more to bring the harsh highlights under control. A different colored background would also be nice. the current one is too close in color to the watch face making for a very monochromatic  feeling presentation.', '2004-07-07 01:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(799070, 88412, 23439, '<td valign="top">Think this would of been better using all different flavors. Otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'Think this would of been better using all different flavors. Otherwise a nice shot.', '2004-07-07 01:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
