(799085, 89286, 10799, '<td valign="top">Taken early or later in the day with a larger apeture this could be an outstanding photo.  As it is the sky is too burnt out and the sunflowers are not crisp and clear except the package.  To show how nice the plants look (Advertisement) you need the real sunflowers to look good too.</td>', 'Taken early or later in the day with a larger apeture this could be an outstanding photo.  As it is the sky is too burnt out and the sunflowers are not crisp and clear except the package.  To show how nice the plants look (Advertisement) you need the real sunflowers to look good too.', '2004-07-07 01:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(799086, 88183, 3459, '<td valign="top">This image to me has a snapshot feel, which is not very grabbing, the brand name is in the shadow and there is no spaces for text.</td>', 'This image to me has a snapshot feel, which is not very grabbing, the brand name is in the shadow and there is no spaces for text.', '2004-07-07 01:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
