(799365, 87402, 16269, '<td valign="top">This is technically very very well carried out. I would love to have some pointers about how to get such crisp photos! The one thing that I would have liked to see is the lime cut... either in half or maybe even those little triangles that you have to slice it into to fit it into the bottle. I know, picky picky. That doesn''t affect your score. hehe... just a personal thought.</td>', 'This is technically very very well carried out. I would love to have some pointers about how to get such crisp photos! The one thing that I would have liked to see is the lime cut... either in half or maybe even those little triangles that you have to slice it into to fit it into the bottle. I know, picky picky. That doesn''t affect your score. hehe... just a personal thought.', '2004-07-07 03:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
