(799608, 89063, 7543, '<td valign="top">A bit of a white balance problem here, the backlight (natural light) is really blue and the frontlight is yellowish, I think this whitebalance contrast makes this shot look like a snapshot. I would rather go with all natural light or all tungsten light and set the white balance setting right on your camera if possible. The image does not show how cold it is out side either. Would love a sip of that though....</td>', 'A bit of a white balance problem here, the backlight (natural light) is really blue and the frontlight is yellowish, I think this whitebalance contrast makes this shot look like a snapshot. I would rather go with all natural light or all tungsten light and set the white balance setting right on your camera if possible. The image does not show how cold it is out side either. Would love a sip of that though....', '2004-07-07 06:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
