(799724, 88853, 21430, '<td valign="top">This shot is kind of boring. (Mine is too, but that''t a different story.)<br/> <br/>Anyway, I find the background makes this shot a little boring. If it was set into a rich natural wood background, like on a counter with ''old'' and rich finished wood sitting in the back it would invoke, for me, the sense of a good kitchen, which is what I would expect from getting this product. As it stands, it looks a little like it might make my food bland...<br/> <br/>  The shot is crisp, has good focus and I do like the light filtering through the product...</td>', 'This shot is kind of boring. (Mine is too, but that''t a different story.) Anyway, I find the background makes this shot a little boring. If it was set into a rich natural wood background, like on a counter with ''old'' and rich finished wood sitting in the back it would invoke, for me, the sense of a good kitchen, which is what I would expect from getting this product. As it stands, it looks a little like it might make my food bland...   The shot is crisp, has good focus and I do like the light filtering through the product...', '2004-07-07 08:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
