(799746, 89102, 19475, '<td valign="top">Wish i could see the whoel glass, but this works ok to. What i really think woudl improve this shot though, is it the foam had been paler and more white. I think it is a bit to yellow no, to look natrual</td>', 'Wish i could see the whoel glass, but this works ok to. What i really think woudl improve this shot though, is it the foam had been paler and more white. I think it is a bit to yellow no, to look natrual', '2004-07-07 08:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(799753, 88674, 7252, '<td valign="top">Attractive photo overall. Kinda looks like the camera front focused a bit making the bottom of the bangs more in focus than the eye. Lighting also seems a bit off. The shadow from the glasses intersects the pretty eye. Might also have been better to have more ambient light so her pupil wouldn''t have dilated so much.</td>', 'Attractive photo overall. Kinda looks like the camera front focused a bit making the bottom of the bangs more in focus than the eye. Lighting also seems a bit off. The shadow from the glasses intersects the pretty eye. Might also have been better to have more ambient light so her pupil wouldn''t have dilated so much.', '2004-07-07 08:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(799757, 89305, 2899, '<td valign="top">I see the serious part....where''s the refreshing part? Color is a bit dark, should have tried it when a flash.</td>', 'I see the serious part....where''s the refreshing part? Color is a bit dark, should have tried it when a flash.', '2004-07-07 08:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(799760, 89223, 7252, '<td valign="top">VW''s have that happy fun image (even though I''ve never met one that didn''t break down all the time) the image could be really powerful and effective as an ad if it had more of that happy vibe. A little brighter, no pole coming out of the roof, maybe the reflection of a beautiful landscape (rather than the parking lot), and somebody hanging out the window to illustrate what a great job the "VW Transporter" is. Anyway, those are just some thoughts. The photo is well focused, sharp and has an interesting angle.</td>', 'VW''s have that happy fun image (even though I''ve never met one that didn''t break down all the time) the image could be really powerful and effective as an ad if it had more of that happy vibe. A little brighter, no pole coming out of the roof, maybe the reflection of a beautiful landscape (rather than the parking lot), and somebody hanging out the window to illustrate what a great job the "VW Transporter" is. Anyway, those are just some thoughts. The photo is well focused, sharp and has an interesting angle.', '2004-07-07 08:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(799763, 89293, 19475, '<td valign="top">The idea is good but unfortenatly it is to over exposed.. There is not much details left of the botle and the sky. My guess is that your camera was fooled by the green and dark foilage in the background. The camera though it was much darker and the shot got overexposed.  To solve this kind of problems you can try and expose at something on aproximatly the same distance, with more natrual light. Lookthat expsure and turn the camera against your composition.</td>', 'The idea is good but unfortenatly it is to over exposed.. There is not much details left of the botle and the sky. My guess is that your camera was fooled by the green and dark foilage in the background. The camera though it was much darker and the shot got overexposed.  To solve this kind of problems you can try and expose at something on aproximatly the same distance, with more natrual light. Lookthat expsure and turn the camera against your composition.', '2004-07-07 08:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
