(799804, 89212, 19952, '<td valign="top">Cute title and nice, clear image. It seems like there''s a reflection to the bottom right of the bottle. This would also be a better image if the bottle were full, but I know you didn''t want to top it off with water. ;-) But still, very nice shot.</td>', 'Cute title and nice, clear image. It seems like there''s a reflection to the bottom right of the bottle. This would also be a better image if the bottle were full, but I know you didn''t want to top it off with water. ;-) But still, very nice shot.', '2004-07-07 09:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
