(799889, 88407, 23251, '<td valign="top">Just a little glare on the table near the base of the glass and I would think some of the bottom could have been croped.  I like the shot though..  BTW I dip mine lol.</td>', 'Just a little glare on the table near the base of the glass and I would think some of the bottom could have been croped.  I like the shot though..  BTW I dip mine lol.', '2004-07-07 10:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(799893, 88002, 23251, '<td valign="top">Sorry I really don''t like this, maybe its the cropping.  Maybe if the whole hand was in or a tighter crop on the ring not sure, the glare off the ring also takes out a lot of detail. Ohh looking again I get the feeling of a foot with really long toes, must be the angle of her wrist!</td>', 'Sorry I really don''t like this, maybe its the cropping.  Maybe if the whole hand was in or a tighter crop on the ring not sure, the glare off the ring also takes out a lot of detail. Ohh looking again I get the feeling of a foot with really long toes, must be the angle of her wrist!', '2004-07-07 11:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(799899, 89323, 21430, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the ice cream being out of focus in the front/center of the shot. It''s a good choice otherwise. The inside of the bowl could use a little cleaning up as well, you don''t see to many adverts with ''food mess'' on the inside rim of a bowl, unless it is intentionally done to show how quickly and messily people gobble up the grub.<br/> <br/>The lighting isn''t to bad either, except for that one patch across the top of the word Bryers. If you had a directional light that could have been pointed ''up'' at the lid of the ice cream container that might have disappeared.</td>', 'I don''t like the ice cream being out of focus in the front/center of the shot. It''s a good choice otherwise. The inside of the bowl could use a little cleaning up as well, you don''t see to many adverts with ''food mess'' on the inside rim of a bowl, unless it is intentionally done to show how quickly and messily people gobble up the grub. The lighting isn''t to bad either, except for that one patch across the top of the word Bryers. If you had a directional light that could have been pointed ''up'' at the lid of the ice cream container that might have disappeared.', '2004-07-07 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(799906, 88817, 21430, '<td valign="top">What an eeeevil, eeeevil design.<br/> <br/>Was it designed by Evilcorp?<br/> <br/>I like the Recycle and Hospitalize(?) icons in the bottom right.<br/> <br/>I would like to see how this was done. <br/> <br/>Did you create an image with the words on it and paste it over your LCD?</td>', 'What an eeeevil, eeeevil design. Was it designed by Evilcorp? I like the Recycle and Hospitalize(?) icons in the bottom right. I would like to see how this was done.  Did you create an image with the words on it and paste it over your LCD?', '2004-07-07 11:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(799915, 89305, 21430, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes the model and the subject a little unappealing. I understand the tone being sought here, but the darkness seems a little ''eh'' to me. It''s a nice concept.<br/> <br/>I think I can just make out your shape reflected in the glass.</td>', 'The lighting makes the model and the subject a little unappealing. I understand the tone being sought here, but the darkness seems a little ''eh'' to me. It''s a nice concept. I think I can just make out your shape reflected in the glass.', '2004-07-07 11:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(799918, 88674, 21430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. It''s a great angle. I am not sure if I like the shadow of the frame across the models face, but it would have been difficult to get this image with the strict rules of Basic Editing as adding more light would have possibly eliminated the shadow on the other side of the face.</td>', 'Nice shot. It''s a great angle. I am not sure if I like the shadow of the frame across the models face, but it would have been difficult to get this image with the strict rules of Basic Editing as adding more light would have possibly eliminated the shadow on the other side of the face.', '2004-07-07 11:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(799919, 89218, 21430, '<td valign="top">Very professional looking. I like the lighting and the background suits this item perfectly. Way to go.</td>', 'Very professional looking. I like the lighting and the background suits this item perfectly. Way to go.', '2004-07-07 11:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(799920, 88255, 22922, '<td valign="top">Very crisp shot, nice sheen.  I like the motion, but I wish you had held the whole camera in the shot.  The floor has an odd texture that reflects on the bottom of the camera as well.</td>', 'Very crisp shot, nice sheen.  I like the motion, but I wish you had held the whole camera in the shot.  The floor has an odd texture that reflects on the bottom of the camera as well.', '2004-07-07 11:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(799923, 89254, 21430, '<td valign="top">I think the bike should be more prominent in this shot, perhaps propped up straigther as well. I have seen a large number of HD ads over the year, as my father is absolutely obsessed with those bikes, and they always place a great deal of emphasis on the bike and the shinyness of its chrome and paintjob.<br/> <br/>It''s a good concept, crisp and in focus. The background suits the ''open road'' theme that HD owners like and want.</td>', 'I think the bike should be more prominent in this shot, perhaps propped up straigther as well. I have seen a large number of HD ads over the year, as my father is absolutely obsessed with those bikes, and they always place a great deal of emphasis on the bike and the shinyness of its chrome and paintjob. It''s a good concept, crisp and in focus. The background suits the ''open road'' theme that HD owners like and want.', '2004-07-07 11:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(799927, 89232, 22922, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, but I would remove the coffee cup.  Seems a tad over-sharpened.  Nice image.</td>', 'Nice setup, but I would remove the coffee cup.  Seems a tad over-sharpened.  Nice image.', '2004-07-07 11:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
