(799970, 89264, 22922, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, but ok execution.  The can is placed too far out of the water, so it looks more like it is floating than being drenched.  The sharpness and detail are really nice, but more foam in the water or a deeper depth for the can would have made the refreshing idea more believable.  Maybe just dropping the can in the stream and shooting it as it was pulled along would have given you a more active shot.</td>', 'A nice idea, but ok execution.  The can is placed too far out of the water, so it looks more like it is floating than being drenched.  The sharpness and detail are really nice, but more foam in the water or a deeper depth for the can would have made the refreshing idea more believable.  Maybe just dropping the can in the stream and shooting it as it was pulled along would have given you a more active shot.', '2004-07-07 11:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
