(799980, 89215, 22922, '<td valign="top">I think this is a perfect shot marred only by unbearable graininess.  The textured background should offset the sleek, smooth pens, but they are so grainy that they don''t stand out as is.  Not sure if this was to do with post processing or not, but try to reprocess it if so.  I love the pose, the simplicity, everything else, just the graininess bothers me.</td>', 'I think this is a perfect shot marred only by unbearable graininess.  The textured background should offset the sleek, smooth pens, but they are so grainy that they don''t stand out as is.  Not sure if this was to do with post processing or not, but try to reprocess it if so.  I love the pose, the simplicity, everything else, just the graininess bothers me.', '2004-07-07 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
