(800055, 89276, 22922, '<td valign="top">Why duotone?  You want people to identify your brand in the store, so make sure it looks the way it will when they go to the store.  Nice wood grain.</td>', 'Why duotone?  You want people to identify your brand in the store, so make sure it looks the way it will when they go to the store.  Nice wood grain.', '2004-07-07 12:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(800056, 88928, 20214, '<td valign="top">Rule number 1, never score food photos on an empty stomach! Nice shot!</td>', 'Rule number 1, never score food photos on an empty stomach! Nice shot!', '2004-07-07 12:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(800057, 88388, 22922, '<td valign="top">Do you really want to show a competitor''s ball in the ad?  This wouls also work better on manicured grass or astroturf, the lawn grass is distracting.  Nice shot, try for a bit more contrast on the bal, the top edge is washed out.</td>', 'Do you really want to show a competitor''s ball in the ad?  This wouls also work better on manicured grass or astroturf, the lawn grass is distracting.  Nice shot, try for a bit more contrast on the bal, the top edge is washed out.', '2004-07-07 12:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(800059, 89289, 22922, '<td valign="top">I love the product image, but lose the extraneous elements (Silk flowers look really bad here).  Get rid of the pink thing on the left and crop to the top of the nearer swan''s head or lower.</td>', 'I love the product image, but lose the extraneous elements (Silk flowers look really bad here).  Get rid of the pink thing on the left and crop to the top of the nearer swan''s head or lower.', '2004-07-07 12:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(800060, 89234, 23628, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the ad in the background with your model. I suspect you''ll have to prove the validity of this shot: I almost submitted it for DQ myself before I saw the people in front of it and understood what I was looking at. I like it though - 8 :)</td>', 'Nice use of the ad in the background with your model. I suspect you''ll have to prove the validity of this shot: I almost submitted it for DQ myself before I saw the people in front of it and understood what I was looking at. I like it though - 8 :)', '2004-07-07 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(800064, 89211, 22922, '<td valign="top">Ha ha :)  I''d love to see this ad for real.</td>', 'Ha ha :)  I''d love to see this ad for real.', '2004-07-07 12:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(800065, 88941, 21978, '<td valign="top">damn I hope not.....haha</td>', 'damn I hope not.....haha', '2004-07-07 12:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(800069, 88941, 22922, '<td valign="top">This is a picture *of* an ad.  Doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'This is a picture *of* an ad.  Doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2004-07-07 12:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(800072, 88215, 22922, '<td valign="top">I think here we need to see the product.</td>', 'I think here we need to see the product.', '2004-07-07 12:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(800073, 89054, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and set up here. The little fruit twist in the glass is a nice touch. Maybe you meant to, but I think the bottle and glass seem tilted to the left. Sometimes that works, but in this case I think it might be better straightened out.</td>', 'I like your idea and set up here. The little fruit twist in the glass is a nice touch. Maybe you meant to, but I think the bottle and glass seem tilted to the left. Sometimes that works, but in this case I think it might be better straightened out.', '2004-07-07 12:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(800074, 88928, 23628, '<td valign="top">Very effective - makes me hungry!</td>', 'Very effective - makes me hungry!', '2004-07-07 12:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(800077, 88821, 23628, '<td valign="top">Awesome focus on the reflection of the clouds. definitely a 10</td>', 'Awesome focus on the reflection of the clouds. definitely a 10', '2004-07-07 12:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(800080, 89079, 22922, '<td valign="top">Don''t even want to know how you put this image together.  I can''t even look at it without freaking out!  Ick.  But nice ad.</td>', 'Don''t even want to know how you put this image together.  I can''t even look at it without freaking out!  Ick.  But nice ad.', '2004-07-07 12:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(800081, 88890, 21978, '<td valign="top">What the hell is it?</td>', 'What the hell is it?', '2004-07-07 12:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(800083, 89090, 22922, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess you aren''t actually entering the challenge, so cute shot.</td>', 'Well, I guess you aren''t actually entering the challenge, so cute shot.', '2004-07-07 12:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(800085, 89082, 21978, '<td valign="top">What is it about "Advertisement" that you don''t understand? What are you trying to sell here?</td>', 'What is it about "Advertisement" that you don''t understand? What are you trying to sell here?', '2004-07-07 12:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(800086, 89218, 22922, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot but also very grainy.  I like this ad.</td>', 'Very nice shot but also very grainy.  I like this ad.', '2004-07-07 12:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(800089, 89051, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really awesome shot. A good print even. I get your idea and I think it does fit the challenge, but if I was running an ad campaign for Texas tourism, I don''t think I would pick this. The composition is great. Still a good score, just could be higher. :-)</td>', 'I think this is a really awesome shot. A good print even. I get your idea and I think it does fit the challenge, but if I was running an ad campaign for Texas tourism, I don''t think I would pick this. The composition is great. Still a good score, just could be higher. :-)', '2004-07-07 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(800090, 89246, 23628, '<td valign="top">Classic presentation, makes me hungry - maybe I shouldn''t vote on this so close to lunchtime - looks like an 8 to me though :)</td>', 'Classic presentation, makes me hungry - maybe I shouldn''t vote on this so close to lunchtime - looks like an 8 to me though :)', '2004-07-07 12:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(800093, 88068, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like your composition very much. The little bow is a very nice touch. I think the focus is a little off, especially on the product.</td>', 'I like your composition very much. The little bow is a very nice touch. I think the focus is a little off, especially on the product.', '2004-07-07 12:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(800097, 88817, 21978, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny, but is it considered basic editing?</td>', 'Pretty funny, but is it considered basic editing?', '2004-07-07 12:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(800102, 88868, 23628, '<td valign="top">A greater depth of field might have worked here, but I like it regardless. I''m only getting a 4 on my photo right now so you don''t necessarily want my advice anyway :)</td>', 'A greater depth of field might have worked here, but I like it regardless. I''m only getting a 4 on my photo right now so you don''t necessarily want my advice anyway :)', '2004-07-07 12:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(800105, 88087, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but I''m not really finding a strong focal point. Perhaps a different arrangement, and really emphasize the label?</td>', 'This is a good idea, but I''m not really finding a strong focal point. Perhaps a different arrangement, and really emphasize the label?', '2004-07-07 13:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(800107, 89009, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Well executed. The glass seems tilted a little, but maybe that works ok here.</td>', 'Cute idea. Well executed. The glass seems tilted a little, but maybe that works ok here.', '2004-07-07 13:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(800108, 88184, 21978, '<td valign="top">Oh very original.............NOT!</td>', 'Oh very original.............NOT!', '2004-07-07 13:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(800110, 88195, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Great composition. I like the title/slogan. Perfect background. The wood has great texture. You should send to Newcastle. I can envision this in a magazine ad! This has to be a top contender. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Great idea. Great composition. I like the title/slogan. Perfect background. The wood has great texture. You should send to Newcastle. I can envision this in a magazine ad! This has to be a top contender. One of my favorites.', '2004-07-07 13:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(800115, 89257, 23628, '<td valign="top">More light on the label would make it easier to read. Nice composition though.</td>', 'More light on the label would make it easier to read. Nice composition though.', '2004-07-07 13:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(800117, 88315, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a creative shot. I get your idea. Generally, I don''t mind borders, however I don''t think this one works well here. Perhaps it''s too big, and the opacity just seems kind of distracting.</td>', 'This is a creative shot. I get your idea. Generally, I don''t mind borders, however I don''t think this one works well here. Perhaps it''s too big, and the opacity just seems kind of distracting.', '2004-07-07 13:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(800124, 88245, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the reflection. The leaf is a very nice touch. The lighting seems to cast a bright spot across the candy. Wouldn''t be too bad but it kind of washes out part of the label, which I think would be important in an advertising situation.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the reflection. The leaf is a very nice touch. The lighting seems to cast a bright spot across the candy. Wouldn''t be too bad but it kind of washes out part of the label, which I think would be important in an advertising situation.', '2004-07-07 13:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(800133, 89220, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea. Nice composition. It does have a classic auto ad feel. I looked for several minutes trying to decide what it seemed to be lacking...i think if it were a little brighter, it would be better. Maybe a little more sunlight, without getting too bright and harsh. I realize, this is the truck you have, but Maybe a brighter color vehicle would pop more, especially with this scene/backdrop.</td>', 'This is a good idea. Nice composition. It does have a classic auto ad feel. I looked for several minutes trying to decide what it seemed to be lacking...i think if it were a little brighter, it would be better. Maybe a little more sunlight, without getting too bright and harsh. I realize, this is the truck you have, but Maybe a brighter color vehicle would pop more, especially with this scene/backdrop.', '2004-07-07 13:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(800134, 86860, 21978, '<td valign="top">Looks more like emphysema to me.</td>', 'Looks more like emphysema to me.', '2004-07-07 13:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(800136, 88845, 16241, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2004-07-07 13:18:09.000000', NULL, 1);
