(800292, 88879, 21430, '<td valign="top">This is a nice take on the Absolut Vodka ads, except for the lack of the Absolut bottle shape...<br/> <br/>Still it''s a very nice shot.</td>', 'This is a nice take on the Absolut Vodka ads, except for the lack of the Absolut bottle shape... Still it''s a very nice shot.', '2004-07-07 14:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
