(800345, 88183, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be better if the bottom half were cropped out. This would put the product into the rule of thirds and would emphasize it much more. It would also fill up the frame and lose what seems like a cluttered distracting background.</td>', 'I think this shot would be better if the bottom half were cropped out. This would put the product into the rule of thirds and would emphasize it much more. It would also fill up the frame and lose what seems like a cluttered distracting background.', '2004-07-07 15:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(800348, 88921, 23673, '<td valign="top">Simple, and perfect. (10)</td>', 'Simple, and perfect. (10)', '2004-07-07 15:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(800350, 88858, 19831, '<td valign="top">I see what you are going for here, but I think your product doesn''t stand out. It just get''s lost with all the other images. I find my eye wandering all over the pic looking at the bright little interesting images.</td>', 'I see what you are going for here, but I think your product doesn''t stand out. It just get''s lost with all the other images. I find my eye wandering all over the pic looking at the bright little interesting images.', '2004-07-07 15:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
