(800440, 88834, 19831, '<td valign="top">Is yellow canoe a specific product? Anyways, i like using the vivid yellow to stand out in the scene. The pic should be bigger though, did you use the full 640 that''s allowed? Also, it seems kind of dark overall, you could probably lighten it up in editing. For greater impact, i think you could have used the "rule of thirds" and moved the framing of the canoe over, either by the original framing or cropping.</td>', 'Is yellow canoe a specific product? Anyways, i like using the vivid yellow to stand out in the scene. The pic should be bigger though, did you use the full 640 that''s allowed? Also, it seems kind of dark overall, you could probably lighten it up in editing. For greater impact, i think you could have used the "rule of thirds" and moved the framing of the canoe over, either by the original framing or cropping.', '2004-07-07 16:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
