(800549, 89013, 4008, '<td valign="top">You have a nice bottle there with a great color eau de toilette, but it could have been made so much more appealing. first make sure the bottle is clean, spotless. Then play with the light, not just from the front. translucent would be great here. And a matching or contrasting attractive colored background. Would all give a very different result. Suggest you try, even though it is too late for the challenge, it is very rewarding.</td>', 'You have a nice bottle there with a great color eau de toilette, but it could have been made so much more appealing. first make sure the bottle is clean, spotless. Then play with the light, not just from the front. translucent would be great here. And a matching or contrasting attractive colored background. Would all give a very different result. Suggest you try, even though it is too late for the challenge, it is very rewarding.', '2004-07-07 16:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
