(800751, 89349, 12362, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2004-07-07 18:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(800755, 88890, 12362, '<td valign="top">I dont know if its my monitor but i cant see the product. Is it guinsess?</td>', 'I dont know if its my monitor but i cant see the product. Is it guinsess?', '2004-07-07 18:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(800762, 88873, 6100, '<td valign="top">Yellow and blue have always been a winning combination of colors. This seems very sharp without, in my opinion, showing signs of oversharpening. I wish the white spots weren''t there because they are distracting but a 10, none-the-less!</td>', 'Yellow and blue have always been a winning combination of colors. This seems very sharp without, in my opinion, showing signs of oversharpening. I wish the white spots weren''t there because they are distracting but a 10, none-the-less!', '2004-07-07 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(800763, 88816, 12362, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good idea too : )</td>', 'Nice shot, good idea too : )', '2004-07-07 18:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(800767, 86995, 12362, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus Melissa. Good composition tho.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus Melissa. Good composition tho.', '2004-07-07 18:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(800769, 88242, 6100, '<td valign="top">The red of the background sort of contrasts with the cherry red on the can but I like how you set up the background to appear as radiating lines. 10.</td>', 'The red of the background sort of contrasts with the cherry red on the can but I like how you set up the background to appear as radiating lines. 10.', '2004-07-07 18:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(800770, 88721, 12362, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Im impressed   : )</td>', 'Great capture. Im impressed   : )', '2004-07-07 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(800772, 89340, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good color choices. The only thing I would like to change is the reflection in the bottle. 10.</td>', 'Good color choices. The only thing I would like to change is the reflection in the bottle. 10.', '2004-07-07 18:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(800773, 86995, 6900, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t at all make me want to go buy this product.</td>', 'Doesn''t at all make me want to go buy this product.', '2004-07-07 18:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(800775, 88215, 12362, '<td valign="top">Good shot, very clear, you should have cropped the shadow in the left part of the picture tho.</td>', 'Good shot, very clear, you should have cropped the shadow in the left part of the picture tho.', '2004-07-07 18:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(800776, 88933, 12362, '<td valign="top">Woaw....speechless.</td>', 'Woaw....speechless.', '2004-07-07 18:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(800779, 89279, 21724, '<td valign="top">go canon!!!  ;)<br/> <br/>seriously though, nice picture..  the black on black on black makes it hard to distinguish the camera from the background.. this is probably what you were going for, but I think it takes away from the quality of the picture.  I would suggest using a background that is dark but not black.. Some textured metal would look especially nice with this one, because it would add to that sense of strength and durability..</td>', 'go canon!!!  ;) seriously though, nice picture..  the black on black on black makes it hard to distinguish the camera from the background.. this is probably what you were going for, but I think it takes away from the quality of the picture.  I would suggest using a background that is dark but not black.. Some textured metal would look especially nice with this one, because it would add to that sense of strength and durability..', '2004-07-07 18:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(800780, 89308, 12362, '<td valign="top">Love it, great focus on the bottle and the little one just completes the shot. 9 : )</td>', 'Love it, great focus on the bottle and the little one just completes the shot. 9 : )', '2004-07-07 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(800783, 89215, 12362, '<td valign="top">Great clear shot. The only think I dont like is the texture of the background, it kinda looks like noise, although im pretty sure its just the texture?</td>', 'Great clear shot. The only think I dont like is the texture of the background, it kinda looks like noise, although im pretty sure its just the texture?', '2004-07-07 18:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(800784, 89270, 12362, '<td valign="top">Great Idea.</td>', 'Great Idea.', '2004-07-07 18:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(800785, 88265, 6100, '<td valign="top">Only thing I can see that might improve this is to eliminate the plant. It would have been nice if you could have also lit the top of the car a little. You''ve still captured a very good image for "Advertisement Revisited." 10.</td>', 'Only thing I can see that might improve this is to eliminate the plant. It would have been nice if you could have also lit the top of the car a little. You''ve still captured a very good image for "Advertisement Revisited." 10.', '2004-07-07 18:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(800786, 89179, 21724, '<td valign="top">fantastic use of white and silver tones!!  DOF is great too.. My only objection is the top of the polish bottle..  that bit of shadow is kind of distracting.  i can''t remember if this challenge was advanced or basic editing, but if you plan to use this picture in the future, I suggest cloning that bit out.</td>', 'fantastic use of white and silver tones!!  DOF is great too.. My only objection is the top of the polish bottle..  that bit of shadow is kind of distracting.  i can''t remember if this challenge was advanced or basic editing, but if you plan to use this picture in the future, I suggest cloning that bit out.', '2004-07-07 18:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(800788, 88921, 21724, '<td valign="top">great colors, love the border.. nice picture :)</td>', 'great colors, love the border.. nice picture :)', '2004-07-07 18:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(800790, 89051, 21724, '<td valign="top">as a fellow texan, I love this picture.. but I know I''ve seen it before (or one that''s very, VERY similar).  I''m not sure if it was here, or in a magazine, but I definitely have seen this pic before.. Hmmmmm..</td>', 'as a fellow texan, I love this picture.. but I know I''ve seen it before (or one that''s very, VERY similar).  I''m not sure if it was here, or in a magazine, but I definitely have seen this pic before.. Hmmmmm..', '2004-07-07 18:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(800797, 88845, 6100, '<td valign="top">Quite a striking image; would make a good advertisement. 10.</td>', 'Quite a striking image; would make a good advertisement. 10.', '2004-07-07 18:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(800808, 89335, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice image but there seems to be a "muddiness" to the background. If the b/g could be either all black or a true white I think the image would improve. 9<br/></td>', 'Nice image but there seems to be a "muddiness" to the background. If the b/g could be either all black or a true white I think the image would improve. 9', '2004-07-07 18:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(800809, 88845, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow. Quite a berry you''ve got there. The high key image with a white background works well to set it off.</td>', 'Wow. Quite a berry you''ve got there. The high key image with a white background works well to set it off.', '2004-07-07 18:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(800810, 88210, 6100, '<td valign="top">Only improvement I could see would be to bring a little --- just a little --- light to the leaf on the left. As it is, it fades into the rock background. Very nice image for this category. 9.</td>', 'Only improvement I could see would be to bring a little --- just a little --- light to the leaf on the left. As it is, it fades into the rock background. Very nice image for this category. 9.', '2004-07-07 18:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
