(800822, 89266, 22046, '<td valign="top">Could use a better slogan but it is a great picture for an advertisement. I could see this one appearing in a number of magazines I get. Excellent work. A 10 in my book.</td>', 'Could use a better slogan but it is a great picture for an advertisement. I could see this one appearing in a number of magazines I get. Excellent work. A 10 in my book.', '2004-07-07 18:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
