(800840, 89229, 22046, '<td valign="top">Clever idea that works for me. You could do a series of these with different body types... cool.</td>', 'Clever idea that works for me. You could do a series of these with different body types... cool.', '2004-07-07 18:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
