(801149, 88293, 23412, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors reflected in the glass.  I like the product placement, but I don''t understand the composition in terms of the 4th of July packaging, the somewhat formal style of glass, and the floral backdrop.  I guess the 4th theme on the bottle is what throws it off for me.</td>', 'Interesting colors reflected in the glass.  I like the product placement, but I don''t understand the composition in terms of the 4th of July packaging, the somewhat formal style of glass, and the floral backdrop.  I guess the 4th theme on the bottle is what throws it off for me.', '2004-07-07 22:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(801158, 88821, 22385, '<td valign="top">This picture does not inspire me in terms of advertising.  However, the way you shot the photo is elusive to me... is this a reflection of the sky on a car hood, perhaps?  While I wouldn''t pick this to win the advertisement challenge, I am impressed by the creativity of the photo, so I would give you a 7.</td>', 'This picture does not inspire me in terms of advertising.  However, the way you shot the photo is elusive to me... is this a reflection of the sky on a car hood, perhaps?  While I wouldn''t pick this to win the advertisement challenge, I am impressed by the creativity of the photo, so I would give you a 7.', '2004-07-07 22:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(801163, 89263, 22385, '<td valign="top">There is a lot going on in this photo.  I assume you are advertising the event on the bottom of the photo?  There is great detail, and while the photo might draw someone to come to the city based upon the backdrop, the event itself seems like the secondary subject of this photo.  I would give this a 7.</td>', 'There is a lot going on in this photo.  I assume you are advertising the event on the bottom of the photo?  There is great detail, and while the photo might draw someone to come to the city based upon the backdrop, the event itself seems like the secondary subject of this photo.  I would give this a 7.', '2004-07-07 22:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(801164, 88395, 22385, '<td valign="top">This photo/advertisement seems like a stretch.  I wish there was more of a reference to the California Lottery in the photo, itself.  This is a great photo, though.</td>', 'This photo/advertisement seems like a stretch.  I wish there was more of a reference to the California Lottery in the photo, itself.  This is a great photo, though.', '2004-07-07 22:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(801170, 89102, 17485, '<td valign="top">Never heard of Carlsberg before, but appealing none the less.  Would like to have seen the bottom half of the glass, but overall nice clarity color and focus.</td>', 'Never heard of Carlsberg before, but appealing none the less.  Would like to have seen the bottom half of the glass, but overall nice clarity color and focus.', '2004-07-07 22:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(801172, 88892, 17485, '<td valign="top">:)  I can see you in the reflections on the bottle, along with the window and what appears to be a tripod.  The light spot on the 3rd bottle is a little eye catching however the clarity and focus is excellent.  Nice shot!</td>', ':)  I can see you in the reflections on the bottle, along with the window and what appears to be a tripod.  The light spot on the 3rd bottle is a little eye catching however the clarity and focus is excellent.  Nice shot!', '2004-07-07 22:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(801173, 87721, 22385, '<td valign="top">I like the title of this advertisement.  However, the photo doesn''t impress me.  I would guess one would want to go out and eat a Snickers bar in such an advertisement.  However, the idea of someone''s hand being a main part of the photo and the Snickers bar being on the carpet (floor?) doesn''t activate my taste buds.  In terms of technical points, the shot seems to be in good focus and pretty good lighting.  Good effort, but unfortunately this may not be a winner for this particular challenge.</td>', 'I like the title of this advertisement.  However, the photo doesn''t impress me.  I would guess one would want to go out and eat a Snickers bar in such an advertisement.  However, the idea of someone''s hand being a main part of the photo and the Snickers bar being on the carpet (floor?) doesn''t activate my taste buds.  In terms of technical points, the shot seems to be in good focus and pretty good lighting.  Good effort, but unfortunately this may not be a winner for this particular challenge.', '2004-07-07 22:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(801174, 89182, 17485, '<td valign="top">How did you get the Polo Sport bottle to stay in his arm?  Nice DOF, would like to have seen the base of the bottle though.</td>', 'How did you get the Polo Sport bottle to stay in his arm?  Nice DOF, would like to have seen the base of the bottle though.', '2004-07-07 22:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
