(801201, 88294, 17485, '<td valign="top">Awesome car!  The only thing that detracts from this photo is the white lines.  A better, more scenic location, would have suited this shot much better that the one presented.  Awesome ride though, I love the car!  :)</td>', 'Awesome car!  The only thing that detracts from this photo is the white lines.  A better, more scenic location, would have suited this shot much better that the one presented.  Awesome ride though, I love the car!  :)', '2004-07-07 22:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(801202, 89251, 22385, '<td valign="top">You know, I really love this shot.  If this were a TV ad, I can just imagine this boy playing the role of a true salesperson to get you to buy this lemonade.  The photo captures my attention.  Good photo for its own sake, too.  This is a 9 in my book.</td>', 'You know, I really love this shot.  If this were a TV ad, I can just imagine this boy playing the role of a true salesperson to get you to buy this lemonade.  The photo captures my attention.  Good photo for its own sake, too.  This is a 9 in my book.', '2004-07-07 22:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(801205, 89345, 17485, '<td valign="top">The shadow on the bottle to the left is a little harsh.  It''s hard to tell where the bottle ends and the shadow begins along the blue section and where the bottle behind it is located.  There is no real separation between the two.</td>', 'The shadow on the bottle to the left is a little harsh.  It''s hard to tell where the bottle ends and the shadow begins along the blue section and where the bottle behind it is located.  There is no real separation between the two.', '2004-07-07 22:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
