(801328, 88820, 3649, '<td valign="top">a little too busy and the darks seem to run together, the light meter fading into the laptop and the phone (stylus?) a little convoluted from this angle.</td>', 'a little too busy and the darks seem to run together, the light meter fading into the laptop and the phone (stylus?) a little convoluted from this angle.', '2004-07-07 23:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
