(801333, 88183, 19841, '<td valign="top">The cute child is a good idea, but the background doesn''t quite work for me.  It seems a little cluttered.  Setting up this shot in a park might have worked better.  I don''t know what Actimel is, but it looks good in this shot!</td>', 'The cute child is a good idea, but the background doesn''t quite work for me.  It seems a little cluttered.  Setting up this shot in a park might have worked better.  I don''t know what Actimel is, but it looks good in this shot!', '2004-07-07 23:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(801335, 88945, 19134, '<td valign="top">Great image!</td>', 'Great image!', '2004-07-07 23:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(801341, 89336, 19841, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and composition, but a bit ambiguous with the title.  Are you selling a VW bus, a toy bus, or a trip?  If it''s a trip, I want to go :)</td>', 'Nice exposure and composition, but a bit ambiguous with the title.  Are you selling a VW bus, a toy bus, or a trip?  If it''s a trip, I want to go :)', '2004-07-07 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(801344, 89279, 3649, '<td valign="top">i like the angle a lot, but very dark, details get lost. Seems a tad soft. (calibrated just yesterday with OptiCAL)</td>', 'i like the angle a lot, but very dark, details get lost. Seems a tad soft. (calibrated just yesterday with OptiCAL)', '2004-07-07 23:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(801346, 89268, 19841, '<td valign="top">A little more depth of field would show off the texture better.  Tasty anyway, though!</td>', 'A little more depth of field would show off the texture better.  Tasty anyway, though!', '2004-07-07 23:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(801348, 89223, 18025, '<td valign="top">An excellent angle - great use of your lens. I find the reflections of other cars in the side of the van and the poll in behind don''t add a lot. If you ever get the chance to reshoot (for your portfolio), you may want to try moving the van to the middle of nowhere and taking the same shot. Very well done and composed though.</td>', 'An excellent angle - great use of your lens. I find the reflections of other cars in the side of the van and the poll in behind don''t add a lot. If you ever get the chance to reshoot (for your portfolio), you may want to try moving the van to the middle of nowhere and taking the same shot. Very well done and composed though.', '2004-07-07 23:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(801349, 88189, 3649, '<td valign="top">drink enough and you won''t see the blur in this shot. better lighting, a sharp image and more saturated colors would count for a good couple of points. There is also a lack of focus, even though the logo would be the obvious focus point, the composition leaves something to be desired.</td>', 'drink enough and you won''t see the blur in this shot. better lighting, a sharp image and more saturated colors would count for a good couple of points. There is also a lack of focus, even though the logo would be the obvious focus point, the composition leaves something to be desired.', '2004-07-07 23:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(801352, 89346, 19841, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, putting the water bottle under water.</td>', 'Neat idea, putting the water bottle under water.', '2004-07-07 23:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(801358, 88189, 18025, '<td valign="top">I"m not sure if it''s the lighting causing some reflections along the middle and bottom, and around the edges of the bottle, but this almost looks out of focus. Sometimes lenses will do this when you take a photo too close to the subject. But I like that it looks like you didn''t use a flash - the colours and tones are well captured.</td>', 'I"m not sure if it''s the lighting causing some reflections along the middle and bottom, and around the edges of the bottle, but this almost looks out of focus. Sometimes lenses will do this when you take a photo too close to the subject. But I like that it looks like you didn''t use a flash - the colours and tones are well captured.', '2004-07-07 23:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(801359, 89317, 19134, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2004-07-07 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(801364, 88934, 18025, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''ve done here. I like the expression and he presentation of the food. It really has an ad feel and I can tell you put a lot of effort into thinking this out. I find some of the harsh reflections (possibly from a flash or hot overhead lighting) shows up on the cans on the top. It''s too bad you can''t do post-processing in this challenge. However, overall very well done.</td>', 'I really like what you''ve done here. I like the expression and he presentation of the food. It really has an ad feel and I can tell you put a lot of effort into thinking this out. I find some of the harsh reflections (possibly from a flash or hot overhead lighting) shows up on the cans on the top. It''s too bad you can''t do post-processing in this challenge. However, overall very well done.', '2004-07-07 23:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(801368, 87475, 14476, '<td valign="top">And indeed Sicily does have magnificant ruins!  This is a good interpretation, but sometimes bracketing exposures gives a better chance at good lights and darks.</td>', 'And indeed Sicily does have magnificant ruins!  This is a good interpretation, but sometimes bracketing exposures gives a better chance at good lights and darks.', '2004-07-07 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
