(801371, 88890, 3649, '<td valign="top">i would love this if perhaps a reflector was used to bring some light into the darkest area of the photo - the right side of the U and the I are almost completely lost. Otherwise, nice close-up, detail, sharpness and color. (display recently calibrated with OptiCAL)</td>', 'i would love this if perhaps a reflector was used to bring some light into the darkest area of the photo - the right side of the U and the I are almost completely lost. Otherwise, nice close-up, detail, sharpness and color. (display recently calibrated with OptiCAL)', '2004-07-07 23:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
