(801406, 88941, 18025, '<td valign="top">I like the message here, but I wonder if it could be improved by having something of your choice in front of it or around it. Righ now, it almost relys on the creative effort of the advertiser. However, I do like the lighting you shot it in and I like the angle.</td>', 'I like the message here, but I wonder if it could be improved by having something of your choice in front of it or around it. Righ now, it almost relys on the creative effort of the advertiser. However, I do like the lighting you shot it in and I like the angle.', '2004-07-07 23:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
