(801742, 88934, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Great composition. It is really great seeing someone doing more than just shoehorning in a cat shot. This is really creative and nails the challenge perfectly. It really shows that one can take the flower, bug, pet, etc. subject of choice, and with some thought and imagination make it work really well. Also, that''s a great looking kitty :-) Great job.</td>', 'Nice idea. Great composition. It is really great seeing someone doing more than just shoehorning in a cat shot. This is really creative and nails the challenge perfectly. It really shows that one can take the flower, bug, pet, etc. subject of choice, and with some thought and imagination make it work really well. Also, that''s a great looking kitty :-) Great job.', '2004-07-08 01:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(801790, 89176, 23939, '<td valign="top">like the shawdows</td>', 'like the shawdows', '2004-07-08 02:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(801791, 89065, 23939, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2004-07-08 02:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(801793, 88868, 15199, '<td valign="top">A bit wider aperture would have made this a top winner</td>', 'A bit wider aperture would have made this a top winner', '2004-07-08 02:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(801799, 89238, 15199, '<td valign="top">Winner colors, depth of field and idea. It just does not feel right with the bottle neck missing.</td>', 'Winner colors, depth of field and idea. It just does not feel right with the bottle neck missing.', '2004-07-08 02:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(801802, 89340, 15199, '<td valign="top">Awesome simplicity and composition. Pity about the uneven lighting on the background. Pure white with flat lighting would have made it better. Also the reflection on the botthle is a bit of a bummer yet I still love it.</td>', 'Awesome simplicity and composition. Pity about the uneven lighting on the background. Pure white with flat lighting would have made it better. Also the reflection on the botthle is a bit of a bummer yet I still love it.', '2004-07-08 02:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(801843, 88339, 16241, '<td valign="top">in fact the more i think about it the more i like it, had to revote and<br/>give you a 10 ........................   best ad, if you dont win i''m going to have<br/>something to say.  lol</td>', 'in fact the more i think about it the more i like it, had to revote andgive you a 10 ........................   best ad, if you dont win i''m going to havesomething to say.  lol', '2004-07-08 03:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
