(801855, 89260, 23251, '<td valign="top">Pretty but very glary, its to hard to see any detail because of the glare.  Nice colours and idea though.</td>', 'Pretty but very glary, its to hard to see any detail because of the glare.  Nice colours and idea though.', '2004-07-08 03:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(801859, 89253, 23251, '<td valign="top">The photo looks kinda foggy, not clear and crisp,  Maybe you were trying to get some glare out but lost the contrast while doing it!</td>', 'The photo looks kinda foggy, not clear and crisp,  Maybe you were trying to get some glare out but lost the contrast while doing it!', '2004-07-08 03:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(801864, 89223, 18461, '<td valign="top">I liked the concept but the gloomyness of the weather makes it unapealling.</td>', 'I liked the concept but the gloomyness of the weather makes it unapealling.', '2004-07-08 03:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(801866, 88408, 23251, '<td valign="top">Overall a good shot, Pity the numbers on the left are kinda fogged over and not sure about the colour of the hand especially the nails! Good background and overall clarity.</td>', 'Overall a good shot, Pity the numbers on the left are kinda fogged over and not sure about the colour of the hand especially the nails! Good background and overall clarity.', '2004-07-08 03:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(801879, 89254, 18461, '<td valign="top">Not enough emphasis on the Harley.  Maybe if you turned the bike in the other direction so it would be leaning away from you would have allowed  more light to be on the bike and you could see more of the bike.  One other thing that may have helped a little more is if you  showed less of the road behind the bike.</td>', 'Not enough emphasis on the Harley.  Maybe if you turned the bike in the other direction so it would be leaning away from you would have allowed  more light to be on the bike and you could see more of the bike.  One other thing that may have helped a little more is if you  showed less of the road behind the bike.', '2004-07-08 03:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(801883, 89333, 18461, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the backgoround.  Only thing that I think would have made it more effective is if you had the ring tilted instead of flat on the table.</td>', 'Love the lighting and the backgoround.  Only thing that I think would have made it more effective is if you had the ring tilted instead of flat on the table.', '2004-07-08 03:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(801885, 88934, 18461, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Especially since you were working with an animal.</td>', 'Nice job.  Especially since you were working with an animal.', '2004-07-08 03:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(801891, 89307, 18461, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice composition but it looks like it may have been taken on an overcast day.  Lacks that brightness you get from bright sunlight.</td>', 'It''s a nice composition but it looks like it may have been taken on an overcast day.  Lacks that brightness you get from bright sunlight.', '2004-07-08 03:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
