(801983, 89169, 8682, '<td valign="top">wow... wow.. just a fantastic shot. I really love the composition and, of course, I want to go to Brazil... Go Ronaldinho &amp; Go Barça!!!! 10</td>', 'wow... wow.. just a fantastic shot. I really love the composition and, of course, I want to go to Brazil... Go Ronaldinho & Go Barça!!!! 10', '2004-07-08 06:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
