(802002, 88890, 7322, '<td valign="top">Guinness? I think one of the first rules of advertising is make sure the product name is visible. I''m just guessing this is Guinness based on the gold and black.</td>', 'Guinness? I think one of the first rules of advertising is make sure the product name is visible. I''m just guessing this is Guinness based on the gold and black.', '2004-07-08 07:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(802004, 89065, 7322, '<td valign="top">The idea might have been more effective if you actually showed the whole deck of cards. This lighting is too dark.</td>', 'The idea might have been more effective if you actually showed the whole deck of cards. This lighting is too dark.', '2004-07-08 07:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(802005, 88254, 7322, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really say anything to me about debt overload or finances. The guy is too fantastical looking to relate to on a human level, for one thing. Nice try, though.</td>', 'This doesn''t really say anything to me about debt overload or finances. The guy is too fantastical looking to relate to on a human level, for one thing. Nice try, though.', '2004-07-08 07:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(802007, 89230, 7322, '<td valign="top">This isn''t the most tantalizing view. It doesn''t make me want to visit Yellowstone Park. It looks drab an uninteresting.</td>', 'This isn''t the most tantalizing view. It doesn''t make me want to visit Yellowstone Park. It looks drab an uninteresting.', '2004-07-08 07:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(802008, 89009, 7322, '<td valign="top">I understand the bra in the background being out of focus, but the product is also out of focus and the cloudy water just looks yucky. The opened box looks messy and unappealing.</td>', 'I understand the bra in the background being out of focus, but the product is also out of focus and the cloudy water just looks yucky. The opened box looks messy and unappealing.', '2004-07-08 07:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(802009, 86995, 7322, '<td valign="top">Is that supposed to be lines of coke? I don''t get it. This is very out of focus.</td>', 'Is that supposed to be lines of coke? I don''t get it. This is very out of focus.', '2004-07-08 07:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(802010, 89090, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is advertising. Is Bump a product? The isn''t all that appealing to me. The woodpecker, looking away and off to the right, doesn''t engage the viewer at all. This is very random  looking.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is advertising. Is Bump a product? The isn''t all that appealing to me. The woodpecker, looking away and off to the right, doesn''t engage the viewer at all. This is very random  looking.', '2004-07-08 07:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(802013, 89182, 7322, '<td valign="top">The cropping is way too tight. The wording and imagery is very silly. You''ll make your Rex jealous? Rex as in king? Or is it a pun, make your Ex jealous? Not really much visual impact and just too goofy to sell me.</td>', 'The cropping is way too tight. The wording and imagery is very silly. You''ll make your Rex jealous? Rex as in king? Or is it a pun, make your Ex jealous? Not really much visual impact and just too goofy to sell me.', '2004-07-08 07:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(802015, 88845, 23251, '<td valign="top">Briliant idea!  Lots of glare off the crome but that is tought to stop. Great focus on the Strawberry. Congrats..  btw the frame suits I think.</td>', 'Briliant idea!  Lots of glare off the crome but that is tought to stop. Great focus on the Strawberry. Congrats..  btw the frame suits I think.', '2004-07-08 07:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(802016, 89200, 7322, '<td valign="top">The boy''s lower lip bulging out over the rim of the can is really unappealing. It looks like his nose is jammed into the can. Next time, take a look at some actual soda ads and notice how they are posed.<br/>The cropping is way too tight. I like the background.</td>', 'The boy''s lower lip bulging out over the rim of the can is really unappealing. It looks like his nose is jammed into the can. Next time, take a look at some actual soda ads and notice how they are posed.The cropping is way too tight. I like the background.', '2004-07-08 07:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(802018, 88425, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot. I think that the goggles are upside down though.</td>', 'Nice Shot. I think that the goggles are upside down though.', '2004-07-08 07:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(802019, 88879, 7322, '<td valign="top">The blurry place setting in the background isn''t too attractive. There is an area of blurry verticals just beyond that that I can''t even figure out. The water isn''t presented in an appealing way. It looks rather stale, just sitting there. Perhaps some ice to make it look more refreshing?</td>', 'The blurry place setting in the background isn''t too attractive. There is an area of blurry verticals just beyond that that I can''t even figure out. The water isn''t presented in an appealing way. It looks rather stale, just sitting there. Perhaps some ice to make it look more refreshing?', '2004-07-08 07:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(802020, 88673, 19959, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Great idea... :-)</td>', 'Interesting. Great idea... :-)', '2004-07-08 07:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(802022, 88413, 7322, '<td valign="top">The title doesn''t sound much like advertising copy. I don''t get it. The photo is very washed out and drab. If the hats are the products, they don''t look attractive enough that I''d want one. For one thing, the hat on the person''s head has grit and lint in the brim. The person''s grizzled, dry, grey hair isn''t too lovely either.</td>', 'The title doesn''t sound much like advertising copy. I don''t get it. The photo is very washed out and drab. If the hats are the products, they don''t look attractive enough that I''d want one. For one thing, the hat on the person''s head has grit and lint in the brim. The person''s grizzled, dry, grey hair isn''t too lovely either.', '2004-07-08 07:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(802024, 89102, 19959, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Deserves to be in the top three. Good composition and lighting.</td>', 'Excellent. Deserves to be in the top three. Good composition and lighting.', '2004-07-08 07:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(802025, 89243, 23251, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatly the photo on the box does not show up well.  It was a great idea though. Very different view point as well.</td>', 'Unfortunatly the photo on the box does not show up well.  It was a great idea though. Very different view point as well.', '2004-07-08 07:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(802026, 89266, 7322, '<td valign="top">Where''s the product? How can I know I want to buy it if I don''t know what it is? You went for cleverness and seemed to have overlooked the fact that you are supposed to be selling a product. <br/>I don''t think the hypothetical clients would be too happy with an ad that didn''t feature their product. <br/>The photo is decent. The glove could be in sharper focus.</td>', 'Where''s the product? How can I know I want to buy it if I don''t know what it is? You went for cleverness and seemed to have overlooked the fact that you are supposed to be selling a product. I don''t think the hypothetical clients would be too happy with an ad that didn''t feature their product. The photo is decent. The glove could be in sharper focus.', '2004-07-08 07:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(802028, 89257, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Just the bubble in the cloth and the stains on the label take a little away. Old bottle though.  You can be very proud of this!</td>', 'Great shot! Just the bubble in the cloth and the stains on the label take a little away. Old bottle though.  You can be very proud of this!', '2004-07-08 07:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(802031, 89305, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice try but it isn''t selling me. I''m distracted by the acne on the model''s face and his looming presence overpowers the product. The bottle of Aquafina should be far more prominent. Remember what you are selling.<br/> <br/><i>Editied post voting...and edited a second time for typos. ;-D</i> <br/> <br/>Hi there...I didn''t mean to be insulting with this comment. When I said ''nice try'' I wasn''t being flip. I really did mean that it was a good effort. As a portrait, it is quite nice actually. Your brother is a handsome subject (I actually thought he was a hired model, in fact) I just felt that his skin needed toning down for the true feel of an advertisment. Models and actors don''t really have perfect skin (ever notice Brad Bitt and Gwen Stefani have some acne scarring?). What they do have is artists who perfect their skin post-production. <br/>Anyway, this was an Open Challenge and there wasn''t much you could do about smoothing out the skin. <br/>I was taking the idea of ''advertisment'' fairly seriously in evaluating these entries so I felt something like that was worth mentioning. If this was meant to be a casual portrait, I wouldn''t have commented on it. <br/> <br/>In terms of the relative prominence of the product, I still feel that the bottle of Aquafina might have been emphasized more strongly. Perhaps with sharper focus and being really choosy with selecting a perfect looking bottle---one that has no wrinkles in the label. A trick I recently read about for photographing water is to replace it with white vinegar which stays very clear and uncloudy. <br/> <br/>My only other feeling about this image is that the color cast is a bit cool and could use warming up in Photoshop. Your brother''s skin which I imagine to be a lovely warm, golden brown looks rather dull and grey, possibly because of the weather conditions at the time of shooting. <br/> <br/>You captured a lovely, intelligent expression, a natural pose, and managed some nice catch lights in his irises.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-20 14:47:26.</i></td>', 'Nice try but it isn''t selling me. I''m distracted by the acne on the model''s face and his looming presence overpowers the product. The bottle of Aquafina should be far more prominent. Remember what you are selling. Editied post voting...and edited a second time for typos. ;-D  Hi there...I didn''t mean to be insulting with this comment. When I said ''nice try'' I wasn''t being flip. I really did mean that it was a good effort. As a portrait, it is quite nice actually. Your brother is a handsome subject (I actually thought he was a hired model, in fact) I just felt that his skin needed toning down for the true feel of an advertisment. Models and actors don''t really have perfect skin (ever notice Brad Bitt and Gwen Stefani have some acne scarring?). What they do have is artists who perfect their skin post-production. Anyway, this was an Open Challenge and there wasn''t much you could do about smoothing out the skin. I was taking the idea of ''advertisment'' fairly seriously in evaluating these entries so I felt something like that was worth mentioning. If this was meant to be a casual portrait, I wouldn''t have commented on it.  In terms of the relative prominence of the product, I still feel that the bottle of Aquafina might have been emphasized more strongly. Perhaps with sharper focus and being really choosy with selecting a perfect looking bottle---one that has no wrinkles in the label. A trick I recently read about for photographing water is to replace it with white vinegar which stays very clear and uncloudy.  My only other feeling about this image is that the color cast is a bit cool and could use warming up in Photoshop. Your brother''s skin which I imagine to be a lovely warm, golden brown looks rather dull and grey, possibly because of the weather conditions at the time of shooting.  You captured a lovely, intelligent expression, a natural pose, and managed some nice catch lights in his irises.', '2004-07-08 07:32:56.000000', '2004-08-20 15:47:26.000000', 1),
(802032, 88364, 7322, '<td valign="top">Pretty good. It makes the point in a fairly interesting way. It doesn''t make me want to check out the link, though.</td>', 'Pretty good. It makes the point in a fairly interesting way. It doesn''t make me want to check out the link, though.', '2004-07-08 07:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(802034, 89287, 7322, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t sell me. My eye keeps wandering to the top right corner where a section of your background paper was puckered and created a shadow. This says ''stack of cans'' more than ''monument'' to me. It might have been more effective to use just one can with a wide angle lens and really sharp focus. This is just kind of dull.</td>', 'Doesn''t sell me. My eye keeps wandering to the top right corner where a section of your background paper was puckered and created a shadow. This says ''stack of cans'' more than ''monument'' to me. It might have been more effective to use just one can with a wide angle lens and really sharp focus. This is just kind of dull.', '2004-07-08 07:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(802036, 89052, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t get this at all. What is the product?  The background cloth looks like an unmade bed. If the product is the lenses then they should be in sharper focus and the brand name should be very prominent. The negatives are in even less focus then the lenses. I have no idea what the red wire thing is supposed to be.</td>', 'I don''t get this at all. What is the product?  The background cloth looks like an unmade bed. If the product is the lenses then they should be in sharper focus and the brand name should be very prominent. The negatives are in even less focus then the lenses. I have no idea what the red wire thing is supposed to be.', '2004-07-08 07:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(802038, 89306, 7322, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing in the glass. Also, I can''t see the entire name on either bottle and neither is in very sharp focus.   Are you selling the glass or the liquor? It''s advertising. The product label should be very clear. There is a blurry triangle shape at the lower left corner that seems to have no place in the set-up.</td>', 'There''s nothing in the glass. Also, I can''t see the entire name on either bottle and neither is in very sharp focus.   Are you selling the glass or the liquor? It''s advertising. The product label should be very clear. There is a blurry triangle shape at the lower left corner that seems to have no place in the set-up.', '2004-07-08 07:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(802040, 88945, 23251, '<td valign="top">Seems to loose defination with all the white.  Looks yummy though.</td>', 'Seems to loose defination with all the white.  Looks yummy though.', '2004-07-08 07:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(802041, 89220, 7322, '<td valign="top">Not bad. This beach setting doesn''t exactly scream rough terrain to me but it''s nice scenery. The focus should be sharp enough for me to be able to read the make and model of the car.</td>', 'Not bad. This beach setting doesn''t exactly scream rough terrain to me but it''s nice scenery. The focus should be sharp enough for me to be able to read the make and model of the car.', '2004-07-08 07:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
