(802219, 89254, 10985, '<td valign="top">Good idea and very good spot for shooting. I have 3 nits, though: there should be someone on the bike, to make it look like more fun, the white part of the clouds is blown out and the horizon is quite tilted. Good composition and very interesting shot, nevertheless.</td>', 'Good idea and very good spot for shooting. I have 3 nits, though: there should be someone on the bike, to make it look like more fun, the white part of the clouds is blown out and the horizon is quite tilted. Good composition and very interesting shot, nevertheless.', '2004-07-08 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(802220, 89040, 23251, '<td valign="top">And its advertising...  What?  Sorry.</td>', 'And its advertising...  What?  Sorry.', '2004-07-08 10:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(802222, 88898, 10985, '<td valign="top">Funny, well done!</td>', 'Funny, well done!', '2004-07-08 10:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(802223, 88892, 19841, '<td valign="top">Nice view of your studio in the reflections!</td>', 'Nice view of your studio in the reflections!', '2004-07-08 10:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(802227, 88879, 18197, '<td valign="top">The right half of the image is terrific. Great reflections. Great contrast. Great focus, DOF, and composition. But the left half of the image detracts. A different crop would have improved this dramatically.</td>', 'The right half of the image is terrific. Great reflections. Great contrast. Great focus, DOF, and composition. But the left half of the image detracts. A different crop would have improved this dramatically.', '2004-07-08 10:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
