(802231, 88245, 23251, '<td valign="top">Only 1 small fault that I can see is the glare on the label.  Pity as it is a great idea. Oh and a better leaf that one has spots and is almost dead.</td>', 'Only 1 small fault that I can see is the glare on the label.  Pity as it is a great idea. Oh and a better leaf that one has spots and is almost dead.', '2004-07-08 10:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
