(802252, 88388, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great concept and I really like the tag line in your title. Focus, contrast and DOF are all good. The thing I find that detracts a bit is the composition. Think about the rule of thirds and consider a different crop. Color seems just a bit flat. Perhaps shooting earlier or later in the day would have helped.</td>', 'Great concept and I really like the tag line in your title. Focus, contrast and DOF are all good. The thing I find that detracts a bit is the composition. Think about the rule of thirds and consider a different crop. Color seems just a bit flat. Perhaps shooting earlier or later in the day would have helped.', '2004-07-08 11:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
