(802273, 88890, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of colors and the contrast. Reflected light is powerful. I think a little more light from the left and possibly from behind the camera would have lightened the rest of the brand name a bit and possibly have improved it.</td>', 'I like the choice of colors and the contrast. Reflected light is powerful. I think a little more light from the left and possibly from behind the camera would have lightened the rest of the brand name a bit and possibly have improved it.', '2004-07-08 11:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(802280, 89167, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the photo. Composition works well. The only things really in focus are the 7 and the 6 which is a bit distracting. Greater depth of field would improve this I think. The silvery reflection of the 7 and the 6 (I am sure it really was silvery in this light) is a bit distracting. Maybe filtering the light would have toned down the silver.</td>', 'I like the idea of the photo. Composition works well. The only things really in focus are the 7 and the 6 which is a bit distracting. Greater depth of field would improve this I think. The silvery reflection of the 7 and the 6 (I am sure it really was silvery in this light) is a bit distracting. Maybe filtering the light would have toned down the silver.', '2004-07-08 11:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(802281, 88921, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wow!<br/> <br/>No, seriously, I like the image. Feels like you got exposure, aperature and focus perfect. The squiggly smoke trails are nice. Color is great. Composition is fine, but I might have tried rotating about 45 degrees if the original image ws large enough to compensate.</td>', 'Wow! No, seriously, I like the image. Feels like you got exposure, aperature and focus perfect. The squiggly smoke trails are nice. Color is great. Composition is fine, but I might have tried rotating about 45 degrees if the original image ws large enough to compensate.', '2004-07-08 11:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(802284, 89293, 21667, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the focus just seems to be a litlle off.</td>', 'Great idea, but the focus just seems to be a litlle off.', '2004-07-08 11:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(802288, 88190, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much. Color, DOF and comp are very good. But I can''t for the life of me figure out what you''d be advertizing. Even the title doesn''t help. Sorry.</td>', 'I like this image very much. Color, DOF and comp are very good. But I can''t for the life of me figure out what you''d be advertizing. Even the title doesn''t help. Sorry.', '2004-07-08 11:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(802290, 89345, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Good focus and DOF. Bollte glass is pretty dark. A bit more light and you could have had some nice refraction stuff going on. I like the title and how it serves as a tag line for the ad.  Pure white background detracts a bit. Some kind of gradient or backdrop would have helped or maybe a Tyrolian scene.</td>', 'Good idea. Good focus and DOF. Bollte glass is pretty dark. A bit more light and you could have had some nice refraction stuff going on. I like the title and how it serves as a tag line for the ad.  Pure white background detracts a bit. Some kind of gradient or backdrop would have helped or maybe a Tyrolian scene.', '2004-07-08 11:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(802291, 89082, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Catching the birds in mid-flight was a good idea. Fast shutter and small aperature did a nice job with depth of field. Sloping horizon detracts a bit. BTW, what are you selling?</td>', 'Nice photo. Catching the birds in mid-flight was a good idea. Fast shutter and small aperature did a nice job with depth of field. Sloping horizon detracts a bit. BTW, what are you selling?', '2004-07-08 11:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(802295, 89040, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the comp and placement of the table, glass and flower. A bit more contrast would help. What are you selling?</td>', 'Nice image. I like the comp and placement of the table, glass and flower. A bit more contrast would help. What are you selling?', '2004-07-08 11:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(802297, 89267, 1570, '<td valign="top">never ever thought that i would actually like a picture of a condom, but there is a first time for everything... this is great, 10!</td>', 'never ever thought that i would actually like a picture of a condom, but there is a first time for everything... this is great, 10!', '2004-07-08 11:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(802298, 86995, 18197, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit noisy. Suggest using something like Neat Image to reduce noise. I am sure there is detail I am missing in the dark areas. Maybe my monitor needs calibration. Looks like trying to score some coke while on a diet.</td>', 'The image is a bit noisy. Suggest using something like Neat Image to reduce noise. I am sure there is detail I am missing in the dark areas. Maybe my monitor needs calibration. Looks like trying to score some coke while on a diet.', '2004-07-08 11:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(802299, 88408, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea well executed. Background detracts a bit. Just slightly greater DOF to bring fingers into focus would help too.</td>', 'Good idea well executed. Background detracts a bit. Just slightly greater DOF to bring fingers into focus would help too.', '2004-07-08 11:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(802304, 88198, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the chipmonk! Focus is awsome. DOF is perfect. Tie in to theme is a bit weak but it''s such a good picture it doesn''t really matter. Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the chipmonk! Focus is awsome. DOF is perfect. Tie in to theme is a bit weak but it''s such a good picture it doesn''t really matter. Good job.', '2004-07-08 11:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(802305, 89051, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, focus and contrast on the dome. I find the dark area a bit distracting but in many ways it enhances the crystal clarity of the dome so I guess it works out okay. Without the title, I would not have known what you were advertising.</td>', 'Very nice lighting, focus and contrast on the dome. I find the dark area a bit distracting but in many ways it enhances the crystal clarity of the dome so I guess it works out okay. Without the title, I would not have known what you were advertising.', '2004-07-08 12:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(802308, 89231, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea nicely composed. Too much levels or curves or saturation or something though. I lose the identity of the product you''re selling.</td>', 'Good idea nicely composed. Too much levels or curves or saturation or something though. I lose the identity of the product you''re selling.', '2004-07-08 12:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(802311, 89253, 18197, '<td valign="top">Sex sells, even when the product is sex! Technically it''s a good workmanlike image but I find this a bit busy.</td>', 'Sex sells, even when the product is sex! Technically it''s a good workmanlike image but I find this a bit busy.', '2004-07-08 12:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(802312, 89293, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Composition is fine. Sky and highlights are blown out, however, which hurts the overall impact.</td>', 'Good idea. Composition is fine. Sky and highlights are blown out, however, which hurts the overall impact.', '2004-07-08 12:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(802315, 86774, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image in terms of focus, composition and tie in to theme. Overall the image seems a bit too dark to me. I think that a light background would have complimented the dark chocolate subject better ... but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Wonderful image in terms of focus, composition and tie in to theme. Overall the image seems a bit too dark to me. I think that a light background would have complimented the dark chocolate subject better ... but that''s just my opinion.', '2004-07-08 12:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(802316, 88817, 18197, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. Thanks. I bumped it point higher than I otherwise would have just for your sense of humor. Good job.</td>', 'This made me smile. Thanks. I bumped it point higher than I otherwise would have just for your sense of humor. Good job.', '2004-07-08 12:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(802321, 89261, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well executed: color, contrast, focus, DOF and comp.</td>', 'Well executed: color, contrast, focus, DOF and comp.', '2004-07-08 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(802322, 88945, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Focus on the strawberry is awsome. A bit more contrast between paper and background would have helped in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice image. Focus on the strawberry is awsome. A bit more contrast between paper and background would have helped in my opinion.', '2004-07-08 12:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(802325, 89095, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I like the reflections, composition, DOF and contrasting elements. But what the heck are you selling?</td>', 'Interesting image. I like the reflections, composition, DOF and contrasting elements. But what the heck are you selling?', '2004-07-08 12:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(802329, 88351, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Black background works well. Focus and slanted image detract a bit.</td>', 'Good idea. Black background works well. Focus and slanted image detract a bit.', '2004-07-08 12:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(802331, 88189, 18197, '<td valign="top">Maybe my eyes are just getting old but this seems a bit out of focus to me. Otherwise a nice capture with good color, comp and tie in to theme.</td>', 'Maybe my eyes are just getting old but this seems a bit out of focus to me. Otherwise a nice capture with good color, comp and tie in to theme.', '2004-07-08 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(802334, 89257, 18197, '<td valign="top">This creates a nice nostalgic feel which compliments the brand very well. Nice job with that. It''s a picky point, and maybe my monitor just needs calibration but the lable on the ink bottle seems too dark. Lighting it a bit more might have improved the image.</td>', 'This creates a nice nostalgic feel which compliments the brand very well. Nice job with that. It''s a picky point, and maybe my monitor just needs calibration but the lable on the ink bottle seems too dark. Lighting it a bit more might have improved the image.', '2004-07-08 12:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(802336, 88407, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great image in many ways. And a great tie in to the theme. Following the rule of thirds would help here I think. If you could move the image down in the frame so the milk and the cookies hit the top and bottom third gridlines, the composition would have been stronger. I think a slightly shorter crop would also help, too.</td>', 'Great image in many ways. And a great tie in to the theme. Following the rule of thirds would help here I think. If you could move the image down in the frame so the milk and the cookies hit the top and bottom third gridlines, the composition would have been stronger. I think a slightly shorter crop would also help, too.', '2004-07-08 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(802338, 88384, 13119, '<td valign="top">Little too dark</td>', 'Little too dark', '2004-07-08 12:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(802340, 89212, 18197, '<td valign="top">The diagonal comp is quite difficult to pull off. It clearly works to show all the product, but I normally expect the diagonal element to somehow emphasize some element of the photo. In this case the background above and below aren''t distinguished in any way. So it weakens the composition a bit.</td>', 'The diagonal comp is quite difficult to pull off. It clearly works to show all the product, but I normally expect the diagonal element to somehow emphasize some element of the photo. In this case the background above and below aren''t distinguished in any way. So it weakens the composition a bit.', '2004-07-08 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(802342, 88885, 18197, '<td valign="top">Cod Livr Oil nevr looked more appealing!  Nice abstract capture. I don''t know if it would motivate me to buy cod liver oil, but it would motivate me to buy this form and brand rather than the old tablespoonful method.</td>', 'Cod Livr Oil nevr looked more appealing!  Nice abstract capture. I don''t know if it would motivate me to buy cod liver oil, but it would motivate me to buy this form and brand rather than the old tablespoonful method.', '2004-07-08 12:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(802344, 88643, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific image. I really like the emotion you''ve created with this shot. The texture, colors and contrast are fabulous. Great job.</td>', 'This is a terrific image. I really like the emotion you''ve created with this shot. The texture, colors and contrast are fabulous. Great job.', '2004-07-08 12:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(802345, 88425, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that the goggles are on upside down. The diagonal element in the background on the left distracts a bit. A slightly different crop could have eliminated it.</td>', 'I like the fact that the goggles are on upside down. The diagonal element in the background on the left distracts a bit. A slightly different crop could have eliminated it.', '2004-07-08 12:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(802347, 88395, 13119, '<td valign="top">nice pic, good isea</td>', 'nice pic, good isea', '2004-07-08 12:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(802349, 89013, 13119, '<td valign="top">little harsh in the light, could have wiped the bottle clean</td>', 'little harsh in the light, could have wiped the bottle clean', '2004-07-08 12:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(802350, 88254, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great image and fine tie in to the theme. Trouble with the Pacific Northwest is the skies are often this blah whitish color. A sunset capture with deep blue skies would be a treat.</td>', 'Great image and fine tie in to the theme. Trouble with the Pacific Northwest is the skies are often this blah whitish color. A sunset capture with deep blue skies would be a treat.', '2004-07-08 12:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(802353, 88880, 13119, '<td valign="top">not enough of the amp in the pic.<br/>Looks like an add for a strat looking reproduction.</td>', 'not enough of the amp in the pic.Looks like an add for a strat looking reproduction.', '2004-07-08 12:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(802355, 88923, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color and contrast. Title gives me pause. A different title whould have strengthend the tie in to the theme. In the end it doesn''t matter much due to the nice capture. Well done.</td>', 'Fantastic color and contrast. Title gives me pause. A different title whould have strengthend the tie in to the theme. In the end it doesn''t matter much due to the nice capture. Well done.', '2004-07-08 12:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(802358, 87970, 13119, '<td valign="top">Great pic, not sure what its an add for.</td>', 'Great pic, not sure what its an add for.', '2004-07-08 12:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(802360, 88132, 18197, '<td valign="top">Watch seems to crowd the frame at the top and the left. A little different crop would have improved this otherwise perfect image. Well done.</td>', 'Watch seems to crowd the frame at the top and the left. A little different crop would have improved this otherwise perfect image. Well done.', '2004-07-08 12:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(802362, 89317, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great job. This image sells!</td>', 'Great job. This image sells!', '2004-07-08 12:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(802363, 88195, 13119, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!</td>', 'Nice idea!', '2004-07-08 12:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(802365, 88415, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific study in light and shadow and refraction. Well done!</td>', 'This is a terrific study in light and shadow and refraction. Well done!', '2004-07-08 12:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(802367, 89254, 18197, '<td valign="top">This image sells! Makes me want a Harley. Good job. A little work with levels, curves or saturation would have deepende the sky a bit and possibly improved this otherwise perfect image.</td>', 'This image sells! Makes me want a Harley. Good job. A little work with levels, curves or saturation would have deepende the sky a bit and possibly improved this otherwise perfect image.', '2004-07-08 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(802368, 89238, 327, '<td valign="top">Must be on the lake front. This looks great. I hope you ribbon, its very good.</td>', 'Must be on the lake front. This looks great. I hope you ribbon, its very good.', '2004-07-08 12:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(802370, 89340, 327, '<td valign="top">Simple. Good lighting, good color. TOP three for me.</td>', 'Simple. Good lighting, good color. TOP three for me.', '2004-07-08 12:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(802371, 89102, 18197, '<td valign="top">Classic shot very well executed. Essentially the perfect image for the challenge. Hope you ribbon.</td>', 'Classic shot very well executed. Essentially the perfect image for the challenge. Hope you ribbon.', '2004-07-08 12:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(802373, 89312, 18197, '<td valign="top">This deserves a 10 in the creative idea department. But the execution brings it down somewhat. Background behind the car detracts. How about a different setting ... on a track possibly? Or even on a beach with golden sand and deep blue sky. Or possibly on a winding "drivers wanted" road at sunset.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This deserves a 10 in the creative idea department. But the execution brings it down somewhat. Background behind the car detracts. How about a different setting ... on a track possibly? Or even on a beach with golden sand and deep blue sky. Or possibly on a winding "drivers wanted" road at sunset. ', '2004-07-08 12:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(802376, 88935, 18197, '<td valign="top">Looks good enough to eat! Good tie in to theme. Virtually flawless execution.</td>', 'Looks good enough to eat! Good tie in to theme. Virtually flawless execution.', '2004-07-08 12:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(802380, 89267, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image well composed. I like the focus. Like the colors. Highlights on the ring are a bit hot. Not much you can do about it in basic editing. Probably a risky subject choice around here, but I hope it does well. Congratulations on a great capture.</td>', 'Nice image well composed. I like the focus. Like the colors. Highlights on the ring are a bit hot. Not much you can do about it in basic editing. Probably a risky subject choice around here, but I hope it does well. Congratulations on a great capture.', '2004-07-08 12:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(802382, 89065, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice job. It does an effective job selling quality AND size, so very good tie in to the theme. Image seems a bit noisy to me.</td>', 'Nice job. It does an effective job selling quality AND size, so very good tie in to the theme. Image seems a bit noisy to me.', '2004-07-08 12:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(802384, 88875, 18197, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Great lighting, focus, contrast and composition. Beautiful tie in to theme. Great job! Hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Great lighting, focus, contrast and composition. Beautiful tie in to theme. Great job! Hope this ribbons.', '2004-07-08 13:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(802386, 88424, 18197, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo in every way. A blue for sure.<br/> <br/>The soft flowing water give this a surreal quality that works well with the product. Technically, a virtually flawless image.</td>', 'Terrific photo in every way. A blue for sure. The soft flowing water give this a surreal quality that works well with the product. Technically, a virtually flawless image.', '2004-07-08 13:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(802388, 88674, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great image that sells. I don''t understand the title but guess I don''t need to. I can see it in a magazine, possibly in my optomitrist''s office. Or possibly as a poster on his wall.</td>', 'Great image that sells. I don''t understand the title but guess I don''t need to. I can see it in a magazine, possibly in my optomitrist''s office. Or possibly as a poster on his wall.', '2004-07-08 13:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(802403, 89263, 20809, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this will not do well although it is an advertisment.  I gove you a Home town 9 though...</td>', 'I have a feeling this will not do well although it is an advertisment.  I gove you a Home town 9 though...', '2004-07-08 13:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(802404, 89317, 16106, '<td valign="top">nice idea, well framed, but a bit of fill light to soften the shadows on the product  would have helped, just a bit of light where the grapes put that hard shadow line on the bottom of the container and it would be fine.</td>', 'nice idea, well framed, but a bit of fill light to soften the shadows on the product  would have helped, just a bit of light where the grapes put that hard shadow line on the bottom of the container and it would be fine.', '2004-07-08 13:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(802406, 89228, 16106, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, but too soft and not product specific for this challenge. Nice color grouping, might be better in the other challenge "purple" as it is the color palate that I like best here.</td>', 'Pretty shot, but too soft and not product specific for this challenge. Nice color grouping, might be better in the other challenge "purple" as it is the color palate that I like best here.', '2004-07-08 13:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(802407, 89006, 19746, '<td valign="top">Pouring needs work :)</td>', 'Pouring needs work :)', '2004-07-08 13:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(802409, 89284, 20809, '<td valign="top">arrgghhh... the car in the bg hurts a nice shot</td>', 'arrgghhh... the car in the bg hurts a nice shot', '2004-07-08 13:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(802411, 89047, 16106, '<td valign="top">Well lit but the DOF is too short for this sort of shot. Either make everything in the shot razor sharp, or tighten it up so the product is the only thing in focus, as it is with the foreground in and the backround out the eye tends to bounce around a bit too much. It is a small quible in a good overall shot.</td>', 'Well lit but the DOF is too short for this sort of shot. Either make everything in the shot razor sharp, or tighten it up so the product is the only thing in focus, as it is with the foreground in and the backround out the eye tends to bounce around a bit too much. It is a small quible in a good overall shot.', '2004-07-08 13:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(802420, 89251, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sorry, no. I''m sure this is a very sweet kid and you love him very much (judging by how often he turns up in challenges) but this is not an appealing photograph. You''ve made the kid more prominent than the product. Also, an advertiser wouldn''t have a model wearing a shirt with a recognizable character unless that was part of the promotion. <br/> <br/>After your angry PM I figured I would elaborate just so you realize I''m not prejudiced against kid photos.  I was unsure in our PM comments if you meant that this was an photograph representing advertisement, i.e, the sign on the fence. If that is the case, then you missed the point of the challenge which was to take a photo of product in a way that sells the product. I''m still approaching this from the idea that this is an ad for Smucker''s lemonade.<br/> <br/>The Scooby Doo t-shirt is very bright, rather cheesy looking, and distracting. As I mentioned in my PM, child models are asked to wear simple, classic, clothing when the clothes aren''t the product being advertised. I don''t think it would be stretching the notion of realism to have the model wearing a sold, or classic striped t-shirt. <br/> <br/>He doesn''t actually look like he is selling lemonade because there are no Dixie cups or other type of disposable cups indicating this. There is only that one big glass. You asked if I had ever sold lemonade as a kid. I lived in the boonies as a kid so I sold flowers by the side of the road, not lemonade, but my kids sold lemonade when they were little and they used paper cups. It doesn''t look like he is by a road it looks like he is in his backyard, judging by the fence and the glass table top. <br/> <br/> The product is secondary to the model and that would never be the case in a real magazine ad.<br/>The lemonade itself has not been photographed in a way to make me want to buy it. It should make me at least think about going to the fridge for a drink. There is very little detail to the pitcher or the glass. You liquid looks dull and opaque and the ice cubes look rather sad and depleted.<br/> <br/> The model''s expression really isn''t all that appealing. His mouth is just sort of hanging open. His eyes are very dark and without a catch light to add sparkle, they appear hollow due to his rather squinty expression. I''ve tried to be as specific with my critique as possible so you understand that am not just randomly voting down photos with kids in them.</td>', 'Sorry, no. I''m sure this is a very sweet kid and you love him very much (judging by how often he turns up in challenges) but this is not an appealing photograph. You''ve made the kid more prominent than the product. Also, an advertiser wouldn''t have a model wearing a shirt with a recognizable character unless that was part of the promotion.  After your angry PM I figured I would elaborate just so you realize I''m not prejudiced against kid photos.  I was unsure in our PM comments if you meant that this was an photograph representing advertisement, i.e, the sign on the fence. If that is the case, then you missed the point of the challenge which was to take a photo of product in a way that sells the product. I''m still approaching this from the idea that this is an ad for Smucker''s lemonade. The Scooby Doo t-shirt is very bright, rather cheesy looking, and distracting. As I mentioned in my PM, child models are asked to wear simple, classic, clothing when the clothes aren''t the product being advertised. I don''t think it would be stretching the notion of realism to have the model wearing a sold, or classic striped t-shirt.  He doesn''t actually look like he is selling lemonade because there are no Dixie cups or other type of disposable cups indicating this. There is only that one big glass. You asked if I had ever sold lemonade as a kid. I lived in the boonies as a kid so I sold flowers by the side of the road, not lemonade, but my kids sold lemonade when they were little and they used paper cups. It doesn''t look like he is by a road it looks like he is in his backyard, judging by the fence and the glass table top.   The product is secondary to the model and that would never be the case in a real magazine ad.The lemonade itself has not been photographed in a way to make me want to buy it. It should make me at least think about going to the fridge for a drink. There is very little detail to the pitcher or the glass. You liquid looks dull and opaque and the ice cubes look rather sad and depleted.  The model''s expression really isn''t all that appealing. His mouth is just sort of hanging open. His eyes are very dark and without a catch light to add sparkle, they appear hollow due to his rather squinty expression. I''ve tried to be as specific with my critique as possible so you understand that am not just randomly voting down photos with kids in them.', '2004-07-08 13:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(802423, 89212, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing a reflection of the bottle on the ''clouds''. Also, there is a blurry triangle patch in the lower right corner. Not a bad effort.</td>', 'I''m seeing a reflection of the bottle on the ''clouds''. Also, there is a blurry triangle patch in the lower right corner. Not a bad effort.', '2004-07-08 13:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(802424, 88339, 12475, '<td valign="top">What a good doggie! :) Very funny shot.</td>', 'What a good doggie! :) Very funny shot.', '2004-07-08 13:35:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(802426, 89215, 7322, '<td valign="top">It might have been more effective if you wrote that copy on the paper in flowy (but readable) script,  showing the output of the product and adding a bit more flair to the composition. It is rather static and dull, as it is.</td>', 'It might have been more effective if you wrote that copy on the paper in flowy (but readable) script,  showing the output of the product and adding a bit more flair to the composition. It is rather static and dull, as it is.', '2004-07-08 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(802431, 89349, 7322, '<td valign="top">Not a bad effort at all. The cheese and crackers look tasty (it is hard to photograph food well). I think the knife was overduing it a tad. The viewer knows how that one slice of cheese got there and the knife doesn''t add anything aesthetic to the composition. It actually leads the eye toward the napkin in the background.</td>', 'Not a bad effort at all. The cheese and crackers look tasty (it is hard to photograph food well). I think the knife was overduing it a tad. The viewer knows how that one slice of cheese got there and the knife doesn''t add anything aesthetic to the composition. It actually leads the eye toward the napkin in the background.', '2004-07-08 13:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(802434, 88356, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''ll take the filters. LOL! This does look rather like an eBay photo but it doesn''t shout ''advertisement'' to me.</td>', 'I''ll take the filters. LOL! This does look rather like an eBay photo but it doesn''t shout ''advertisement'' to me.', '2004-07-08 13:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(802437, 89182, 19746, '<td valign="top">Great use of humour in this one, went through these with a buddy and we really collectively enjoyed your little pun :) Feel the lighting is perhaps a bit too ''rude'' on the actual bottle, but overall it''s a really cool shot, very much enjoyed :) Sending an 8 your way, great shootin''!</td>', 'Great use of humour in this one, went through these with a buddy and we really collectively enjoyed your little pun :) Feel the lighting is perhaps a bit too ''rude'' on the actual bottle, but overall it''s a really cool shot, very much enjoyed :) Sending an 8 your way, great shootin''!', '2004-07-08 13:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(802442, 89212, 12362, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the bottom left corner is distracting tho.</td>', 'Great shot, the bottom left corner is distracting tho.', '2004-07-08 13:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
