(802449, 88633, 7322, '<td valign="top">The idea was to make a photo that looked like an ad not a photo showing advertisement. This looks like what you would see on a yard sale table. Not real appealing product. Photographically, it just seems to be a point-and-shoot snap shot.</td>', 'The idea was to make a photo that looked like an ad not a photo showing advertisement. This looks like what you would see on a yard sale table. Not real appealing product. Photographically, it just seems to be a point-and-shoot snap shot.', '2004-07-08 13:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(802450, 88643, 7322, '<td valign="top">I should be able to see the imprint on the tool better. There is a bit too much shadow around the tool. Not a bad effort, though.</td>', 'I should be able to see the imprint on the tool better. There is a bit too much shadow around the tool. Not a bad effort, though.', '2004-07-08 13:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(802454, 89238, 7322, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a refreshing sight. And I don''t mean the beer, although that looks nice. But this looks like an real honest attempt at advertising (forgive the contradiction in terms). The product is prominently placed against a simple but attractive (and appropriate) background. The beverage actually <i>looks</i> refreshing in it''s frosty glass and I can read the label. The glass itself is attractive and harmonizes with the environment. A winning effort!</td>', 'Wow, what a refreshing sight. And I don''t mean the beer, although that looks nice. But this looks like an real honest attempt at advertising (forgive the contradiction in terms). The product is prominently placed against a simple but attractive (and appropriate) background. The beverage actually looks refreshing in it''s frosty glass and I can read the label. The glass itself is attractive and harmonizes with the environment. A winning effort!', '2004-07-08 13:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(802456, 89095, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is interesting but it doesn''t say ''advertisement'' to me.</td>', 'This is interesting but it doesn''t say ''advertisement'' to me.', '2004-07-08 13:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(802462, 88674, 7322, '<td valign="top">My luck is turning! Another really nice effort! Great model, good expression, prominent product placement. It reminds me of some great ads for specs that appeared a few years back. Rufus Wainwright was in one of them. I can''t remember the brand name. Anyhoo, I really like this. The specs could perhaps be in a bit sharper focus but when compared against the great composition (shows understanding of effective tight cropping and not just random tight cropping), the appealing model, the good makeup, the great lighting, that is a minor nit. A winning effort!</td>', 'My luck is turning! Another really nice effort! Great model, good expression, prominent product placement. It reminds me of some great ads for specs that appeared a few years back. Rufus Wainwright was in one of them. I can''t remember the brand name. Anyhoo, I really like this. The specs could perhaps be in a bit sharper focus but when compared against the great composition (shows understanding of effective tight cropping and not just random tight cropping), the appealing model, the good makeup, the great lighting, that is a minor nit. A winning effort!', '2004-07-08 14:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
