(803011, 89181, 19751, '<td valign="top">baseless?? how does that enhance the ad? I''m not sure what that means</td>', 'baseless?? how does that enhance the ad? I''m not sure what that means', '2004-07-08 21:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(803014, 89173, 19751, '<td valign="top">advertisement for....?</td>', 'advertisement for....?', '2004-07-08 21:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(803016, 89014, 19751, '<td valign="top">cute hat!</td>', 'cute hat!', '2004-07-08 21:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(803019, 88834, 19751, '<td valign="top">the image is kinda on the small side. is this an advertisement for the canoe or for recreation? i dont see it</td>', 'the image is kinda on the small side. is this an advertisement for the canoe or for recreation? i dont see it', '2004-07-08 21:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(803021, 89287, 19751, '<td valign="top">the light part of the cans blends in too much with the background. the top two cans look great, but too much of a relection in the bottom ones. It would also help if the picture was level.</td>', 'the light part of the cans blends in too much with the background. the top two cans look great, but too much of a relection in the bottom ones. It would also help if the picture was level.', '2004-07-08 21:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(803022, 86813, 19751, '<td valign="top">was this dropped in water or something? Its hard to see</td>', 'was this dropped in water or something? Its hard to see', '2004-07-08 21:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(803024, 88364, 19751, '<td valign="top">nice ad for a button store</td>', 'nice ad for a button store', '2004-07-08 21:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(803030, 89345, 22913, '<td valign="top">Nice shot , made me thirsty, shame the two bottles on the left wern''t a bit more defined. Well done</td>', 'Nice shot , made me thirsty, shame the two bottles on the left wern''t a bit more defined. Well done', '2004-07-08 21:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(803031, 88087, 19751, '<td valign="top">there is an edge of something up in the top middle. this image is also way too compressed. more definition would increase the score of this photo</td>', 'there is an edge of something up in the top middle. this image is also way too compressed. more definition would increase the score of this photo', '2004-07-08 21:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(803034, 89008, 19751, '<td valign="top">is this green coffee? weird..</td>', 'is this green coffee? weird..', '2004-07-08 21:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(803036, 89222, 22913, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the contrast, well done</td>', 'Nice shot, love the contrast, well done', '2004-07-08 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(803037, 89289, 19751, '<td valign="top">the suds and Lever bar are too close to the same color under this lighting.</td>', 'the suds and Lever bar are too close to the same color under this lighting.', '2004-07-08 21:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(803038, 89234, 11587, '<td valign="top">Cool pic.  dont know what your tryng to show, wants what?</td>', 'Cool pic.  dont know what your tryng to show, wants what?', '2004-07-08 21:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(803039, 89260, 19751, '<td valign="top">its hard to even tell this is a firewire drive. Mine sure doesnt look like that!</td>', 'its hard to even tell this is a firewire drive. Mine sure doesnt look like that!', '2004-07-08 21:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(803042, 89243, 19751, '<td valign="top">image is a little small. clever idea.</td>', 'image is a little small. clever idea.', '2004-07-08 21:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(803047, 89263, 22913, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. looks like the place that I would like to visit.</td>', 'Very nice shot. looks like the place that I would like to visit.', '2004-07-08 21:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(803048, 89273, 19751, '<td valign="top">way too compressed. plus, this isnt even an advertisement.</td>', 'way too compressed. plus, this isnt even an advertisement.', '2004-07-08 21:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(803049, 89289, 22913, '<td valign="top">Well thought out. lighting is superb, Great effort</td>', 'Well thought out. lighting is superb, Great effort', '2004-07-08 21:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(803050, 87712, 19751, '<td valign="top">this would be good, but you can hardly see the nike signs on the shoes. lighting with less shadows and that doesnt wash the color out would be better too.</td>', 'this would be good, but you can hardly see the nike signs on the shoes. lighting with less shadows and that doesnt wash the color out would be better too.', '2004-07-08 21:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(803052, 89179, 22913, '<td valign="top">Great theme use well done</td>', 'Great theme use well done', '2004-07-08 21:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(803056, 89309, 22913, '<td valign="top">As a techo I appreciate the humor, well done</td>', 'As a techo I appreciate the humor, well done', '2004-07-08 21:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(803061, 88195, 16269, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this. I would have liked to see the hook pierced through the bottle cap, but that''s just a personal preference.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this. I would have liked to see the hook pierced through the bottle cap, but that''s just a personal preference.', '2004-07-08 21:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(803063, 89212, 16269, '<td valign="top">The little... uhh.. thing... in the bottom right corner is kind of disturbing. Other than that, this is actually one of my favorites in the entire challenge. It really strikes me and makes me want to buy some! hehe.. nice work!</td>', 'The little... uhh.. thing... in the bottom right corner is kind of disturbing. Other than that, this is actually one of my favorites in the entire challenge. It really strikes me and makes me want to buy some! hehe.. nice work!', '2004-07-08 21:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(803082, 88828, 18868, '<td valign="top">I understand that you''re trying to create a dramatic foreground/background contrast, but the tree completely obscures the subject of the photo.</td>', 'I understand that you''re trying to create a dramatic foreground/background contrast, but the tree completely obscures the subject of the photo.', '2004-07-08 21:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(803085, 88184, 18868, '<td valign="top">the plant (?) in the background is very distracting, and doesn''t add to the message -- had the background been out-of-place (for example in front of a auto dealer) and conveying the message of WHERE the yellow pages will walk you to, it would support the message.</td>', 'the plant (?) in the background is very distracting, and doesn''t add to the message -- had the background been out-of-place (for example in front of a auto dealer) and conveying the message of WHERE the yellow pages will walk you to, it would support the message.', '2004-07-08 21:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(803089, 88941, 19708, '<td valign="top">Shooting an image of a billboard really doesn''t show your creativity. I think I understand the point of the image based on the title.  It really isn''t your work, but someone else''s.<br/>If I''m wrong, private e-mail me and let me know.<br/>Regards,</td>', 'Shooting an image of a billboard really doesn''t show your creativity. I think I understand the point of the image based on the title.  It really isn''t your work, but someone else''s.If I''m wrong, private e-mail me and let me know.Regards,', '2004-07-08 21:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(803090, 89349, 18868, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but the product isn''t the "center of attention", and the upper edge of the label is out of focus.  For advertising, the props must support the product, not the other way around.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but the product isn''t the "center of attention", and the upper edge of the label is out of focus.  For advertising, the props must support the product, not the other way around.', '2004-07-08 22:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(803093, 89101, 22922, '<td valign="top">Except that this looks like it''s from a magazine in the 70''s, I think it''s a great ad.  Nice DOF.</td>', 'Except that this looks like it''s from a magazine in the 70''s, I think it''s a great ad.  Nice DOF.', '2004-07-08 22:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(803094, 89212, 18868, '<td valign="top">Outstanding sharpness over the whole product, and the background supports rather than distracts from the concept.  I would have liked to seen more background around the product, without the little triangle.</td>', 'Outstanding sharpness over the whole product, and the background supports rather than distracts from the concept.  I would have liked to seen more background around the product, without the little triangle.', '2004-07-08 22:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(803096, 88821, 22922, '<td valign="top">Nice, doesn''t really look like a contact lens here, but a nice image.</td>', 'Nice, doesn''t really look like a contact lens here, but a nice image.', '2004-07-08 22:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(803100, 89165, 22922, '<td valign="top">As nice as your composition is, this looks like a snapshot from the family album.  The clouds don''t make the theme park look very appealling, and the people are all blurry.  we should see smiling faces and sunny skies in a theme park ad.</td>', 'As nice as your composition is, this looks like a snapshot from the family album.  The clouds don''t make the theme park look very appealling, and the people are all blurry.  we should see smiling faces and sunny skies in a theme park ad.', '2004-07-08 22:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(803101, 89307, 18868, '<td valign="top">Is your client selling flowers?  DNMC.</td>', 'Is your client selling flowers?  DNMC.', '2004-07-08 22:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(803103, 89212, 22922, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t crop that bottom corner.  Otherwise a nice, clear ad, good color and sharpness.  Would have helped if the bottle was full :)</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t crop that bottom corner.  Otherwise a nice, clear ad, good color and sharpness.  Would have helped if the bottle was full :)', '2004-07-08 22:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(803104, 89215, 18868, '<td valign="top">Crisp focus on the entire product, good.  Nicely designed framing, good.  Pretty significantly overhsharpened, not so good.</td>', 'Crisp focus on the entire product, good.  Nicely designed framing, good.  Pretty significantly overhsharpened, not so good.', '2004-07-08 22:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(803106, 89182, 22922, '<td valign="top">Not really an ad I can see catching on.  Nice sharpness, not so great ad.</td>', 'Not really an ad I can see catching on.  Nice sharpness, not so great ad.', '2004-07-08 22:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(803108, 88191, 18868, '<td valign="top">Reasonably nice shot, I like the design and long shutter is nice for the flowing look of the beer, but the image is generally flat, and there'' slots of noise in the background.  There''s no "E" in Stella Artoris.  Almost there, need work on the technical aspects.</td>', 'Reasonably nice shot, I like the design and long shutter is nice for the flowing look of the beer, but the image is generally flat, and there'' slots of noise in the background.  There''s no "E" in Stella Artoris.  Almost there, need work on the technical aspects.', '2004-07-08 22:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(803109, 89261, 22922, '<td valign="top">This is already an ad, you didn''t actually create an advertisement.  Anyway, the icon is not centered in the frame, and the left cheekbone is too bright, in fact many of the highlights are washed out.  Photo appears grainy, but it could just be the logo is dirty.</td>', 'This is already an ad, you didn''t actually create an advertisement.  Anyway, the icon is not centered in the frame, and the left cheekbone is too bright, in fact many of the highlights are washed out.  Photo appears grainy, but it could just be the logo is dirty.', '2004-07-08 22:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(803113, 89013, 22922, '<td valign="top">You took a nice picture of the bottle, but there''s nothing else in the picture.  If the challenge was "Bottles" this might have scored a bit higher.  It''s very clear and sharp, but not very interesting at all.  Try to think about what people want to see in a poster or magazine, and work from there.</td>', 'You took a nice picture of the bottle, but there''s nothing else in the picture.  If the challenge was "Bottles" this might have scored a bit higher.  It''s very clear and sharp, but not very interesting at all.  Try to think about what people want to see in a poster or magazine, and work from there.', '2004-07-08 22:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(803114, 88848, 18868, '<td valign="top">Bonus points for the good concept.  Pretty nice execution: reasonably sharp across the image, but you need to set the white balance when you shoot or use your editing program to remove the red tungsten-light cast.</td>', 'Bonus points for the good concept.  Pretty nice execution: reasonably sharp across the image, but you need to set the white balance when you shoot or use your editing program to remove the red tungsten-light cast.', '2004-07-08 22:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(803116, 89220, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the subject isn''t centered and the day was a little drab.  I know, no control over the weather, but the image wouldn''t be accepted by "the client" without a brilliant blue sky.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the subject isn''t centered and the day was a little drab.  I know, no control over the weather, but the image wouldn''t be accepted by "the client" without a brilliant blue sky.', '2004-07-08 22:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(803117, 88828, 22922, '<td valign="top">Why the doorframe? The picture is very sharp and nice, with good color balance, but it''s not an ad or even a print.  Think about what someone who had never heard of your product/subject/town would get out of your image.  Remember that context often shades our own opinion of our photos, but my neighborhood hot dog stand looks pretty much like every other hot dog stand to someone who doesn''t know me or my town.</td>', 'Why the doorframe? The picture is very sharp and nice, with good color balance, but it''s not an ad or even a print.  Think about what someone who had never heard of your product/subject/town would get out of your image.  Remember that context often shades our own opinion of our photos, but my neighborhood hot dog stand looks pretty much like every other hot dog stand to someone who doesn''t know me or my town.', '2004-07-08 22:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(803118, 88256, 22922, '<td valign="top">Nice ad, wish we could get closer.  Could use a bit more focus, not sure if you oversharpened or if the edges are just cranky from the bright light. Good entry!</td>', 'Nice ad, wish we could get closer.  Could use a bit more focus, not sure if you oversharpened or if the edges are just cranky from the bright light. Good entry!', '2004-07-08 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(803121, 88817, 22922, '<td valign="top">Extra points for humor :)  Going with the flow, I''d ask for a tighter crop top and bottom!</td>', 'Extra points for humor :)  Going with the flow, I''d ask for a tighter crop top and bottom!', '2004-07-08 22:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(803122, 89054, 18868, '<td valign="top">Dang -- so very close to a 10, but you can''t read the label, and there''s a very hot highlight down the middle.  Sell the product not the prop, glasshoppah.</td>', 'Dang -- so very close to a 10, but you can''t read the label, and there''s a very hot highlight down the middle.  Sell the product not the prop, glasshoppah.', '2004-07-08 22:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(803124, 89340, 22922, '<td valign="top">How does everyone get these perfect white backgrounds?  Nice shot, would maybe work a little better if we could see liquid in the bottle.  I like it, though.</td>', 'How does everyone get these perfect white backgrounds?  Nice shot, would maybe work a little better if we could see liquid in the bottle.  I like it, though.', '2004-07-08 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(803129, 88894, 18868, '<td valign="top">No actual grouses were harmed in the making of this advertisement.  Contrast and color are extremely good, but highlights are a bit harsh.  Maybe a difuser (paper, white sheet, lingere?!) and a slightly longer exposure would solve that.</td>', 'No actual grouses were harmed in the making of this advertisement.  Contrast and color are extremely good, but highlights are a bit harsh.  Maybe a difuser (paper, white sheet, lingere?!) and a slightly longer exposure would solve that.', '2004-07-08 22:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(803130, 89231, 22922, '<td valign="top">I think there''s something wrong with your image.  It''s very dark (and yes, i can see the gradient bar clearly) and extremely pixelated.  Not sure what''s up here.</td>', 'I think there''s something wrong with your image.  It''s very dark (and yes, i can see the gradient bar clearly) and extremely pixelated.  Not sure what''s up here.', '2004-07-08 22:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(803134, 88898, 18868, '<td valign="top">Good concept -- I''m surprised more folks aren''t doing phony products.  The antiquie camera in the background is distracting, and the product is too big.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Good concept -- I''m surprised more folks aren''t doing phony products.  The antiquie camera in the background is distracting, and the product is too big.  Nice lighting.', '2004-07-08 22:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(803140, 89293, 22922, '<td valign="top">This image would be nice if you toned down the brightness considerably.  I can ahrdly see the bottle, it''s so bright.</td>', 'This image would be nice if you toned down the brightness considerably.  I can ahrdly see the bottle, it''s so bright.', '2004-07-08 22:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(803144, 88408, 22922, '<td valign="top">Your desaturation left fuzzy bits of color throughout, nice try, though.</td>', 'Your desaturation left fuzzy bits of color throughout, nice try, though.', '2004-07-08 22:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(803154, 88132, 18868, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shot, beautifully lit.  I''d like to see more room around it on the top &amp; left.  Top 20 if not top 10.</td>', 'Beautifully shot, beautifully lit.  I''d like to see more room around it on the top & left.  Top 20 if not top 10.', '2004-07-08 22:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(803156, 89312, 18868, '<td valign="top">Outstanding concept, smart execution.  I''d have liked to see sky in the shot  It doensn''t hurt that I''m an RC car geek too.  :)</td>', 'Outstanding concept, smart execution.  I''d have liked to see sky in the shot  It doensn''t hurt that I''m an RC car geek too.  :)', '2004-07-08 22:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(803161, 89257, 18868, '<td valign="top">Presumably, the product is the ink, and a client would not stand for an old, stained, chipped example of their product to be featured in their advertisement.  The photography, however is really outstanding!</td>', 'Presumably, the product is the ink, and a client would not stand for an old, stained, chipped example of their product to be featured in their advertisement.  The photography, however is really outstanding!', '2004-07-08 22:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(803163, 88945, 18868, '<td valign="top">Helloooo top 10.  I might have shot it on a darker neutral gray background so you could get a better exposure, and the contrast would have made the subject more prominent.</td>', 'Helloooo top 10.  I might have shot it on a darker neutral gray background so you could get a better exposure, and the contrast would have made the subject more prominent.', '2004-07-08 22:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(803166, 89238, 18868, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setting, beautiful setup, but no client would pay for a shot that doesn''t feature their whole product.</td>', 'Beautiful setting, beautiful setup, but no client would pay for a shot that doesn''t feature their whole product.', '2004-07-08 22:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(803167, 88424, 18868, '<td valign="top">Sweeeeeeeeet!  Outstanding use of long shutter, beautiful setting, excellent exposure.</td>', 'Sweeeeeeeeet!  Outstanding use of long shutter, beautiful setting, excellent exposure.', '2004-07-08 22:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(803168, 88643, 18868, '<td valign="top">White balance is off.</td>', 'White balance is off.', '2004-07-08 22:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(803172, 89211, 18868, '<td valign="top">The shot is pretty ordinary, but the title rocks.</td>', 'The shot is pretty ordinary, but the title rocks.', '2004-07-08 23:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(803176, 88673, 18799, '<td valign="top">"cracked" me up!  8</td>', '"cracked" me up!  8', '2004-07-08 23:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(803182, 89311, 18868, '<td valign="top">Reverse the importance: you''re selling the prop, not the product.</td>', 'Reverse the importance: you''re selling the prop, not the product.', '2004-07-08 23:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(803186, 88817, 18868, '<td valign="top">DANG.  That''s some funny s**t.  Killer title, ordinary photo.</td>', 'DANG.  That''s some funny s**t.  Killer title, ordinary photo.', '2004-07-08 23:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(803187, 88210, 18868, '<td valign="top">Now that is a handsome shot!  Well done.</td>', 'Now that is a handsome shot!  Well done.', '2004-07-08 23:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(803207, 89101, 18868, '<td valign="top">Say, does Sekonic make a white balance meter?</td>', 'Say, does Sekonic make a white balance meter?', '2004-07-08 23:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(803208, 88866, 23412, '<td valign="top">The angles could''ve been more helpful on this.  Looks like you wanted the sunrise and the top of the balloon, and you touched near both of them.  The trees are somewhat distracting.  Good concept with strong potential.</td>', 'The angles could''ve been more helpful on this.  Looks like you wanted the sunrise and the top of the balloon, and you touched near both of them.  The trees are somewhat distracting.  Good concept with strong potential.', '2004-07-08 23:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(803217, 89267, 23435, '<td valign="top">Very clever and funny.  You deserve a ribbon for originality!</td>', 'Very clever and funny.  You deserve a ribbon for originality!', '2004-07-08 23:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(803223, 88395, 23435, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, very well done.</td>', 'Nice colors, very well done.', '2004-07-08 23:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(803224, 88255, 23412, '<td valign="top">I like the movement on the lense.</td>', 'I like the movement on the lense.', '2004-07-08 23:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(803228, 88384, 23435, '<td valign="top">You should have gone color and worked a little harder on lighting and focus.</td>', 'You should have gone color and worked a little harder on lighting and focus.', '2004-07-08 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(803234, 89213, 23435, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it', '2004-07-08 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(803236, 88934, 23435, '<td valign="top">Must have been tough to shoot.  Light is a little arsh on the cat.  Well done.</td>', 'Must have been tough to shoot.  Light is a little arsh on the cat.  Well done.', '2004-07-08 23:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(803246, 88339, 23435, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.  Just love the expression on the dogs face.  Looks like he''s not happy to go to work!  You deserve a ribbon.</td>', 'Excellent work.  Just love the expression on the dogs face.  Looks like he''s not happy to go to work!  You deserve a ribbon.', '2004-07-08 23:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
