(803573, 88934, 23251, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of glare off the cans and shadow on the cat.  Somehow the cats eyes look kinda funny as well. Good idea maybe next time use something to difuse the light.</td>', 'There is a lot of glare off the cans and shadow on the cat.  Somehow the cats eyes look kinda funny as well. Good idea maybe next time use something to difuse the light.', '2004-07-09 08:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
