(803585, 89286, 13365, '<td valign="top">i really like the idea of this photo, i just wish it wasn''t so overexposed.</td>', 'i really like the idea of this photo, i just wish it wasn''t so overexposed.', '2004-07-09 09:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(803592, 89312, 20685, '<td valign="top">really good, great idea. Unlike so many pics this week this is the only one so far I can actually see being a great ad.</td>', 'really good, great idea. Unlike so many pics this week this is the only one so far I can actually see being a great ad.', '2004-07-09 09:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(803624, 89006, 21430, '<td valign="top">The concept is very nice. <br/> <br/>The image needs more lighting to offset the shadows or to send the shadows off into one direction. The background is also a little dull and could use a little sprucing up with something else that enhances the refreshment concept.</td>', 'The concept is very nice.  The image needs more lighting to offset the shadows or to send the shadows off into one direction. The background is also a little dull and could use a little sprucing up with something else that enhances the refreshment concept.', '2004-07-09 10:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(803641, 89273, 19841, '<td valign="top">C''mon, put a little thought into your entries.  You take good pictures, you just need to go that extra step.  What could this seal be advertizing?  It could be the Zoo, a Nature show, a Travel agent or even Tupperware.  All "ummm" says to me is that you couldn''t be bothered to pick one.  It''''s not cheating to ask your friends or family for help on this, either.    Keep working on it, I see a lot of potential in this.</td>', 'C''mon, put a little thought into your entries.  You take good pictures, you just need to go that extra step.  What could this seal be advertizing?  It could be the Zoo, a Nature show, a Travel agent or even Tupperware.  All "ummm" says to me is that you couldn''t be bothered to pick one.  It''''s not cheating to ask your friends or family for help on this, either.    Keep working on it, I see a lot of potential in this.', '2004-07-09 10:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(803645, 89211, 21430, '<td valign="top">Hehe... That''s a great one!<br/> <br/>Wonderfully funny concept. The shot has come out nice as well.</td>', 'Hehe... That''s a great one! Wonderfully funny concept. The shot has come out nice as well.', '2004-07-09 10:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(803649, 89173, 19841, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I think "Boating News" would have been a better title, though.</td>', 'Great photo.  I think "Boating News" would have been a better title, though.', '2004-07-09 10:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(803655, 89260, 19841, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is, but it looks really cool!</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is, but it looks really cool!', '2004-07-09 10:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(803658, 89292, 19841, '<td valign="top">What a great idea!</td>', 'What a great idea!', '2004-07-09 10:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
