(803725, 88293, 20662, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the glass could have been closer to the bottle and filled with the sparkling juice for a tighter shot. Cool design on the bottle, makes for a nice selcetion for the challenge.</td>', 'Perhaps the glass could have been closer to the bottle and filled with the sparkling juice for a tighter shot. Cool design on the bottle, makes for a nice selcetion for the challenge.', '2004-07-09 12:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
