(803873, 88657, 21430, '<td valign="top">Great model. The shot, to me, is very nice. That look is very cool too.<br/> <br/>If I didn''t already wear glasses, this would deifnately get my interested in doing so...</td>', 'Great model. The shot, to me, is very nice. That look is very cool too. If I didn''t already wear glasses, this would deifnately get my interested in doing so...', '2004-07-09 14:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
