(803876, 87712, 21430, '<td valign="top">Very Cool shot. I like the soft color tones in this image and the subject is very cool to.<br/> <br/>It suggests a use for the running shoes, without saying to the viewer to run out and... well... start running...</td>', 'Very Cool shot. I like the soft color tones in this image and the subject is very cool to. It suggests a use for the running shoes, without saying to the viewer to run out and... well... start running...', '2004-07-09 14:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(803879, 88941, 21430, '<td valign="top">I am giving you a low score, not for the subject matter, but that you basiclly took a shot of someone elses art. It wouldn''t have mattered what the billboard was of.<br/> <br/>If you had found a similar looking model, or a model that could be made to ''look'' gay (Whatever that means) and had a sign being held or next to him talking abotu Mr. Gay.com 2004,  I would have provided a higher score.</td>', 'I am giving you a low score, not for the subject matter, but that you basiclly took a shot of someone elses art. It wouldn''t have mattered what the billboard was of. If you had found a similar looking model, or a model that could be made to ''look'' gay (Whatever that means) and had a sign being held or next to him talking abotu Mr. Gay.com 2004,  I would have provided a higher score.', '2004-07-09 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
