(803884, 89339, 21430, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice concept. I would score this higher if the background were a little brighter and the shoes had less or no wear and tear on them...</td>', 'It''s a nice concept. I would score this higher if the background were a little brighter and the shoes had less or no wear and tear on them...', '2004-07-09 14:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(803886, 89229, 21430, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... Water.<br/> <br/>I am a happily married heterosexual man and still this image is attractive in an almost naughty way... (Because there is no way that hand is a woman''s hand...)<br/> <br/>Very well done.</td>', 'Hmmm.... Water. I am a happily married heterosexual man and still this image is attractive in an almost naughty way... (Because there is no way that hand is a woman''s hand...) Very well done.', '2004-07-09 14:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
