(804123, 88925, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this and the slow shutter speed makes the falls quite dramatic. It looks like there was a little camera shake. Did you use a tripod? If so, did you use a remote, or timed release, or cable to trigger the shutter?</td>', 'I like the composition of this and the slow shutter speed makes the falls quite dramatic. It looks like there was a little camera shake. Did you use a tripod? If so, did you use a remote, or timed release, or cable to trigger the shutter?', '2004-07-09 18:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
