(804127, 89090, 18197, '<td valign="top">It is an attention grabbing photo, certainly at the thumbnail level. I like the layered background. But I can''t figure out what''s being advertised.</td>', 'It is an attention grabbing photo, certainly at the thumbnail level. I like the layered background. But I can''t figure out what''s being advertised.', '2004-07-09 18:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
