(804132, 89220, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a good workmanlike image and it presents an attractive image of the truck. Good DOF. But it doesn''t drag me to the Toyota store panting to buy. The sun being high in the sky flattens the image. Maybe next time try shooting at sunrise or sunset.</td>', 'This is a good workmanlike image and it presents an attractive image of the truck. Good DOF. But it doesn''t drag me to the Toyota store panting to buy. The sun being high in the sky flattens the image. Maybe next time try shooting at sunrise or sunset.', '2004-07-09 18:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(804137, 88858, 18197, '<td valign="top">It''s a bright and colorful image that would appeal to kids who are its intended advertising audience I''m sure. But it feels like the setup is over lighted. Maybe turning down the lights and angling them from the sides a bit would help. And it''s a bit busy for my taste, but it''s been a long time since our kid days, what do I know?</td>', 'It''s a bright and colorful image that would appeal to kids who are its intended advertising audience I''m sure. But it feels like the setup is over lighted. Maybe turning down the lights and angling them from the sides a bit would help. And it''s a bit busy for my taste, but it''s been a long time since our kid days, what do I know?', '2004-07-09 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(804141, 89243, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea. The hue and saturation of the box and the real brownies are such that the real brownes merge together with the box. Hard to tell the real from the box.</td>', 'Very interesting idea. The hue and saturation of the box and the real brownies are such that the real brownes merge together with the box. Hard to tell the real from the box.', '2004-07-09 18:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
