(804319, 87712, 14671, '<td valign="top">The shoes look to be a little blurry on both computers.  The pastey white legs also throw a greenish hue into the picture that is unappealing.  If your advertising a product it is always advisable to show the label or symbol such as the Nike swirl to make the product stand out so people remember what they were looking at.  Beautiful background tho.</td>', 'The shoes look to be a little blurry on both computers.  The pastey white legs also throw a greenish hue into the picture that is unappealing.  If your advertising a product it is always advisable to show the label or symbol such as the Nike swirl to make the product stand out so people remember what they were looking at.  Beautiful background tho.', '2004-07-09 21:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(804321, 89008, 14671, '<td valign="top">interesting shot and great lighting.  I think you could have done without the spoons and the second cup of java.  A more compact shot would have more appeal to the people as this would suggest that it is a simple product.  The angle of the shot looks a little off centered or it may be because of the background or positioning. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'interesting shot and great lighting.  I think you could have done without the spoons and the second cup of java.  A more compact shot would have more appeal to the people as this would suggest that it is a simple product.  The angle of the shot looks a little off centered or it may be because of the background or positioning. <5>', '2004-07-09 21:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(804324, 88142, 14671, '<td valign="top">The balance of the picture is off.  It appears to be a little crooked and for some reason the treats are not as clear as the beans. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'The balance of the picture is off.  It appears to be a little crooked and for some reason the treats are not as clear as the beans. <5>', '2004-07-09 21:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(804325, 88933, 14671, '<td valign="top">In my opinion its just not a very appealing shot.</td>', 'In my opinion its just not a very appealing shot.', '2004-07-09 21:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(804329, 89006, 14671, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this looks rushed because of the overflow of the foam.  I think the shot would have had more appeal it you used a warm beer and a frosted beer mug and a slow poor.  This way as the beer warms the glass up the beer would have a crisper look to it.  Aslo a warm beer so the bottle doesn''t look sweaty.  Bottle alone was a good shot but the glass made you lose marks.</td>', 'In my opinion this looks rushed because of the overflow of the foam.  I think the shot would have had more appeal it you used a warm beer and a frosted beer mug and a slow poor.  This way as the beer warms the glass up the beer would have a crisper look to it.  Aslo a warm beer so the bottle doesn''t look sweaty.  Bottle alone was a good shot but the glass made you lose marks.', '2004-07-09 22:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
