(804502, 88265, 10768, '<td valign="top">I really like the POV that this photo was shot.  Also think it was a good decision to shoot at night as it makes the different tones of the silver really pop out.  This photo screams "new, sleek, sophisticated".  Good use of the Porsche sign to get your selling point across.  Well done!</td>', 'I really like the POV that this photo was shot.  Also think it was a good decision to shoot at night as it makes the different tones of the silver really pop out.  This photo screams "new, sleek, sophisticated".  Good use of the Porsche sign to get your selling point across.  Well done!', '2004-07-10 01:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(804509, 89212, 10768, '<td valign="top">Clear, crisp shot.  This jumps out at you.  The only thing I would recommend is to clone out the little triangle at the bottom left corner.</td>', 'Clear, crisp shot.  This jumps out at you.  The only thing I would recommend is to clone out the little triangle at the bottom left corner.', '2004-07-10 01:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
