(805131, 88351, 22385, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative photo!  But there a few things that bother me... photo could be rotated a tad to make everything straight.  The reflection on the can and glass is distracting, and the model''s hand is blurred (perhaps due to slow shutter speed).  I like the concept overall, though!</td>', 'This is a very creative photo!  But there a few things that bother me... photo could be rotated a tad to make everything straight.  The reflection on the can and glass is distracting, and the model''s hand is blurred (perhaps due to slow shutter speed).  I like the concept overall, though!', '2004-07-10 18:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(805132, 89273, 24021, '<td valign="top">What is this photo supposed to be advertising?</td>', 'What is this photo supposed to be advertising?', '2004-07-10 18:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(805133, 89218, 22385, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic photo.  I can''t think of anything to really improve this photo.  A top three ribbon photo!  I give you a 10!</td>', 'Absolutely fantastic photo.  I can''t think of anything to really improve this photo.  A top three ribbon photo!  I give you a 10!', '2004-07-10 18:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(805138, 87965, 22385, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  This is hilarious!  Maybe focus could be a tad better on the bottle itself, but you might have chosen to do a soft focus (so you may have intended it).  Definitely a memorable advertisement.</td>', 'Oh my!  This is hilarious!  Maybe focus could be a tad better on the bottle itself, but you might have chosen to do a soft focus (so you may have intended it).  Definitely a memorable advertisement.', '2004-07-10 18:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(805143, 87712, 22385, '<td valign="top">Sneakers are a bit blurry, and the skin on the model seems lifeless - very gray.  Is Nike''s phrase "Just do it" intended in this advertisement to mean go on a vacation, or go snorkeling?</td>', 'Sneakers are a bit blurry, and the skin on the model seems lifeless - very gray.  Is Nike''s phrase "Just do it" intended in this advertisement to mean go on a vacation, or go snorkeling?', '2004-07-10 18:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
