(805259, 89211, 17279, '<td valign="top">ROFLMAO!  That is just too funny!</td>', 'ROFLMAO!  That is just too funny!', '2004-07-10 20:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(805261, 88412, 17279, '<td valign="top">Very elegant! I give it an 8.  Would have gone 9, but the image is not quite square (the tops of the two end bottles are different distances from the edge).</td>', 'Very elegant! I give it an 8.  Would have gone 9, but the image is not quite square (the tops of the two end bottles are different distances from the edge).', '2004-07-10 20:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(805339, 89178, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like the tones and the contrast of the dark trees behind.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like the tones and the contrast of the dark trees behind.', '2004-07-10 22:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(805342, 89054, 10339, '<td valign="top">I love the blue tones captured through the entire picture Nice, clear focus throughout. The bottle and glass appear to be leaning to the left. Maybe a bit of rotation would have helped.</td>', 'I love the blue tones captured through the entire picture Nice, clear focus throughout. The bottle and glass appear to be leaning to the left. Maybe a bit of rotation would have helped.', '2004-07-10 22:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(805343, 89311, 17890, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, looks like an advertisement although i think i would have had focus on the olive tin rather than the drink</td>', 'very nice photo, looks like an advertisement although i think i would have had focus on the olive tin rather than the drink', '2004-07-10 22:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(805344, 88351, 22011, '<td valign="top">The horizon appears to hav fallen to the right in your part of the world... :-).    The straight-on lighting is a bit harsh as well, which is more of a problem than the falling over.</td>', 'The horizon appears to hav fallen to the right in your part of the world... :-).    The straight-on lighting is a bit harsh as well, which is more of a problem than the falling over.', '2004-07-10 22:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(805345, 89238, 23673, '<td valign="top">It''s a little hard to read the label.. (or are my eyes just tired?) Your glass has a great cold/wet effect going, but the bottle comes up lacking.  Great background!!</td>', 'It''s a little hard to read the label.. (or are my eyes just tired?) Your glass has a great cold/wet effect going, but the bottle comes up lacking.  Great background!!', '2004-07-10 22:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(805346, 88885, 22011, '<td valign="top">I love the colour in this shot, although the highlights are disturbing, it works well.</td>', 'I love the colour in this shot, although the highlights are disturbing, it works well.', '2004-07-10 22:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(805348, 88198, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I think that you have captured the lighting and the focus just right.</td>', 'Nice composition. I think that you have captured the lighting and the focus just right.', '2004-07-10 22:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(805350, 89272, 23673, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all! The black background seems a little abrupt to me behind the soft cuddly white toilet paper.</td>', 'Not bad at all! The black background seems a little abrupt to me behind the soft cuddly white toilet paper.', '2004-07-10 22:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(805351, 89317, 22011, '<td valign="top">Colours and exposure look bang-on, although I would have been keen on seeing less harsh shadows.  A reflector of some kind (sheet of white paper) above and to the left if you only had one light source might have done the trick, just to lighten them a little, you don''t want to wind up ''flattening'' the light, just less contrasty shadows..</td>', 'Colours and exposure look bang-on, although I would have been keen on seeing less harsh shadows.  A reflector of some kind (sheet of white paper) above and to the left if you only had one light source might have done the trick, just to lighten them a little, you don''t want to wind up ''flattening'' the light, just less contrasty shadows..', '2004-07-10 22:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(805352, 89253, 18349, '<td valign="top">Someone has quite a collection...but I''m sure it''s for the articles. <img alt="'' . substr(''//smilies.sofrayt.com/fsc/sunglasses2.gif'', strrpos(''//smilies.sofrayt.com/fsc/sunglasses2.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//smilies.sofrayt.com/fsc/sunglasses2.gif"/></td>', 'Someone has quite a collection...but I''m sure it''s for the articles. ', '2004-07-10 22:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(805353, 89284, 10339, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject and feel that you have captured the challenge well. The over-bright background and black car somehow distract from the overall feeling of the picture.</td>', 'I really like the subject and feel that you have captured the challenge well. The over-bright background and black car somehow distract from the overall feeling of the picture.', '2004-07-10 22:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(805354, 89079, 23673, '<td valign="top">Part of the label is out of focus (but I bet someone else has already brought that to your attention) I love the cockroaches though, very nice formation!</td>', 'Part of the label is out of focus (but I bet someone else has already brought that to your attention) I love the cockroaches though, very nice formation!', '2004-07-10 22:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(805357, 89270, 19590, '<td valign="top">Great ad simple and tastefull</td>', 'Great ad simple and tastefull', '2004-07-10 22:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(805358, 89232, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and bacground. There seems to be some ''noise'' in the top of the coffee can and the rim of the cup.</td>', 'Nice subject and bacground. There seems to be some ''noise'' in the top of the coffee can and the rim of the cup.', '2004-07-10 22:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(805359, 88189, 22011, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a bit of what looks like motion blur in this shot, which is distracting..  Either that or I''ve already been into the rum :-).  Exposure and colour are good.  A tripod, or stack of books and self-timer are your friends.</td>', 'You''ve got a bit of what looks like motion blur in this shot, which is distracting..  Either that or I''ve already been into the rum :-).  Exposure and colour are good.  A tripod, or stack of books and self-timer are your friends.', '2004-07-10 22:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(805364, 89040, 23673, '<td valign="top">Let''s ask the obvious: what are we advertising here? I like the idea, the rough background just doesn''t seem to fit to me. Your daisy is soft and smooth, just like the glass and the surface its sitting on (smooth, not soft).  Anyways, just a suggestion, experiment!</td>', 'Let''s ask the obvious: what are we advertising here? I like the idea, the rough background just doesn''t seem to fit to me. Your daisy is soft and smooth, just like the glass and the surface its sitting on (smooth, not soft).  Anyways, just a suggestion, experiment!', '2004-07-10 22:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(805365, 89291, 22011, '<td valign="top">Great use of a fish-eye.  I''ll be intersted to see what focal length this was after voting, because if this isn''t a full-frame dSLR, this must be a stupidly wide angle lens! :-).<br/> <br/>If you were able to, it would have been intersting to turn ouf the other lights in the room, and just have the cabinet ones on, as some of the surrounds are a little distracting from the subject.</td>', 'Great use of a fish-eye.  I''ll be intersted to see what focal length this was after voting, because if this isn''t a full-frame dSLR, this must be a stupidly wide angle lens! :-). If you were able to, it would have been intersting to turn ouf the other lights in the room, and just have the cabinet ones on, as some of the surrounds are a little distracting from the subject.', '2004-07-10 22:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(805367, 89179, 23673, '<td valign="top">I love the silver,,, ness? As I found with a lot of the labels in this challenge, I can''t read the small print, you''re not alone.</td>', 'I love the silver,,, ness? As I found with a lot of the labels in this challenge, I can''t read the small print, you''re not alone.', '2004-07-10 22:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(805369, 89261, 23673, '<td valign="top">It''s nice and simple, but somewhat grainy.  Perfect title!</td>', 'It''s nice and simple, but somewhat grainy.  Perfect title!', '2004-07-10 22:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(805372, 88721, 22011, '<td valign="top">This would make many a sponsor happy.  Their logo in action.  The only thing it needs to be perfect is the other cyclists in his dust..  Wee cayght action shot, with a good level of motion blur to give us the feeling of speed.</td>', 'This would make many a sponsor happy.  Their logo in action.  The only thing it needs to be perfect is the other cyclists in his dust..  Wee cayght action shot, with a good level of motion blur to give us the feeling of speed.', '2004-07-10 22:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(805373, 89312, 10339, '<td valign="top">Great concept. I love the FG and BG for this.</td>', 'Great concept. I love the FG and BG for this.', '2004-07-10 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(805375, 89311, 23673, '<td valign="top">Your drink is fantastic!  Your can of olives doesn''t look very appealing though.. it''s out of focus, and kind of hiding behind your perfect martini.</td>', 'Your drink is fantastic!  Your can of olives doesn''t look very appealing though.. it''s out of focus, and kind of hiding behind your perfect martini.', '2004-07-10 22:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
