(805381, 89040, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is undoubtably a nice photo of a daisy, as you say, in a champagne glass.  But Advertising?<br/> <br/>The highlights on the glass left and right are a little distracting, and the lump on the stem under the surface of the water is also a bit out of place.</td>', 'This is undoubtably a nice photo of a daisy, as you say, in a champagne glass.  But Advertising? The highlights on the glass left and right are a little distracting, and the lump on the stem under the surface of the water is also a bit out of place.', '2004-07-10 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
