(805392, 88593, 23673, '<td valign="top">Your sky background is a little grainy. Your grass is crisp and sharp, and the cold  wet bottle looks pretty refreshing.  I''d center it a little to the right, and tilt the bottle a little more straight.</td>', 'Your sky background is a little grainy. Your grass is crisp and sharp, and the cold  wet bottle looks pretty refreshing.  I''d center it a little to the right, and tilt the bottle a little more straight.', '2004-07-10 23:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
