(805543, 88633, 23251, '<td valign="top">Looks a little washed out, I think if the contrast was tweeked a bit it would help.  A bit of fill flash may have helped with the shadows as well.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'Looks a little washed out, I think if the contrast was tweeked a bit it would help.  A bit of fill flash may have helped with the shadows as well.  Nice idea though.', '2004-07-11 01:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
