(805560, 89274, 14812, '<td valign="top">Very good concept. Picture needs just a tad bit more exposure, as everything looks a bit grey. The head is a bit cut off on the left side, and I would have loved to see the two eyes symmetrical in detail.</td>', 'Very good concept. Picture needs just a tad bit more exposure, as everything looks a bit grey. The head is a bit cut off on the left side, and I would have loved to see the two eyes symmetrical in detail.', '2004-07-11 02:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
