(806058, 89206, 7322, '<td valign="top">A bit small to get a good feel for the image quality. The label is easily red so it looks like your focus is pretty good.  I like the color, lighting and composition. I''m not sure about the background which appears to be either a towel or fleece blanket. Velvet would have worked much nicer. I just wish it were a bit bigger.</td>', 'A bit small to get a good feel for the image quality. The label is easily red so it looks like your focus is pretty good.  I like the color, lighting and composition. I''m not sure about the background which appears to be either a towel or fleece blanket. Velvet would have worked much nicer. I just wish it were a bit bigger.', '2004-07-11 16:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(806059, 89009, 16241, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2004-07-11 16:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(806060, 89243, 16241, '<td valign="top">yum</td>', 'yum', '2004-07-11 16:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(806061, 88898, 7322, '<td valign="top">Funny idea. I''m not sure about the bacgkround and the surface the product is sitting on. It looks rather haphazard and not as well thought out as the labeling. The background, although blurry, still looks a bit complicated and distracting. I keep trying to figure out what the object at the top of the frame is. The surface appears to be some sort of old metal case or box. I shouldn''t be wondering about this kind of thing. The crop is a bit too severe at the right and there seems to be a slight tilt.</td>', 'Funny idea. I''m not sure about the bacgkround and the surface the product is sitting on. It looks rather haphazard and not as well thought out as the labeling. The background, although blurry, still looks a bit complicated and distracting. I keep trying to figure out what the object at the top of the frame is. The surface appears to be some sort of old metal case or box. I shouldn''t be wondering about this kind of thing. The crop is a bit too severe at the right and there seems to be a slight tilt.', '2004-07-11 16:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(806063, 89223, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cool subject but it is a bit dark and high contrast (very few middle values). The reflection on the bus is distracting and there is some kind of pole sticking out from the top.</td>', 'Cool subject but it is a bit dark and high contrast (very few middle values). The reflection on the bus is distracting and there is some kind of pole sticking out from the top.', '2004-07-11 16:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(806064, 88200, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting of the product but the framing is a bit narrow. Also, the bottle should have been included in the composition. It''s supposed to be an advertisement, after all. I''m not nuts about the bluish-green cast of the lighting on the background.</td>', 'Nice lighting of the product but the framing is a bit narrow. Also, the bottle should have been included in the composition. It''s supposed to be an advertisement, after all. I''m not nuts about the bluish-green cast of the lighting on the background.', '2004-07-11 16:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(806067, 89274, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting and original. The focus isn''t perfect (or the quality has been degraded in compression). I''d like a bit more generous cropping at the top of the frame.</td>', 'Interesting and original. The focus isn''t perfect (or the quality has been degraded in compression). I''d like a bit more generous cropping at the top of the frame.', '2004-07-11 16:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(806071, 89051, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I''ve seen this shot done better, though (on DPC). I guess the intention was to get the star centered in the frame but the result seems to be the dark portion of the building at the right that makes for a weird composition.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I''ve seen this shot done better, though (on DPC). I guess the intention was to get the star centered in the frame but the result seems to be the dark portion of the building at the right that makes for a weird composition.', '2004-07-11 16:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(806076, 88876, 7322, '<td valign="top">The cropping is much too tight and there is no sparkle in the dogs eye. Worse, there is a glowing portion visible from its right eye. It has the quality of a snapshot.</td>', 'The cropping is much too tight and there is no sparkle in the dogs eye. Worse, there is a glowing portion visible from its right eye. It has the quality of a snapshot.', '2004-07-11 16:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(806081, 88934, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is just a great add, just a little more texture on the cat''s chest would''ve been nice... still, this is 10!</td>', 'this is just a great add, just a little more texture on the cat''s chest would''ve been nice... still, this is 10!', '2004-07-11 16:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(806082, 89229, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The selective desaturation actually works (I usually don''t like this technique) and the body is healthy looking and attractive. The only beef I have is that at first it is hard to tell the gender of the model at first glance. I thought it was a woman because of the rounded belly. Then I noticed the ribcage was too heavy for a woman. After that, I saw the hands and the belly button hair and figured it out for sure. I think next time, unless the male model is really cut and defined, you should have him (or yourself) suck in for the shot. I''m pretty sure you aren''t allowed in Open Challenges but if this had been a member challenge I would have also suggested cloning out the freckles. <br/>Still, one of the best I''ve seen so far. It shows the product prominently; it isn''t overwhelmed by the model. It''s a good composition and it is very clear to the veiwer what is being advertised. The somewhat androgynous quality of the figure actually could be a help, when one thinks abou it.</td>', 'Very nice. The selective desaturation actually works (I usually don''t like this technique) and the body is healthy looking and attractive. The only beef I have is that at first it is hard to tell the gender of the model at first glance. I thought it was a woman because of the rounded belly. Then I noticed the ribcage was too heavy for a woman. After that, I saw the hands and the belly button hair and figured it out for sure. I think next time, unless the male model is really cut and defined, you should have him (or yourself) suck in for the shot. I''m pretty sure you aren''t allowed in Open Challenges but if this had been a member challenge I would have also suggested cloning out the freckles. Still, one of the best I''ve seen so far. It shows the product prominently; it isn''t overwhelmed by the model. It''s a good composition and it is very clear to the veiwer what is being advertised. The somewhat androgynous quality of the figure actually could be a help, when one thinks abou it.', '2004-07-11 16:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(806084, 88894, 1570, '<td valign="top">just a little too much emphasis on your background with the matte going into shine... still, it''s a compelling ad - 8.</td>', 'just a little too much emphasis on your background with the matte going into shine... still, it''s a compelling ad - 8.', '2004-07-11 16:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(806086, 88873, 11897, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp, my number 1 picture, good luck 10</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp, my number 1 picture, good luck 10', '2004-07-11 16:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(806087, 88721, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very good. The labeling on his clothes should be a bit more in focus but I can see how this would be difficult. If it were a real add, the print would avoid any confusion for the viewer but it still wouldn''t be perfect. Someone who doesn''t know much about the sport (like myself) can not immediately identify what the product is. It could be the bike itself, the brakes, the tires, the helmet, or the clothing. <br/>Still, that is a just a minor nit. This one is quite good.</td>', 'Very good. The labeling on his clothes should be a bit more in focus but I can see how this would be difficult. If it were a real add, the print would avoid any confusion for the viewer but it still wouldn''t be perfect. Someone who doesn''t know much about the sport (like myself) can not immediately identify what the product is. It could be the bike itself, the brakes, the tires, the helmet, or the clothing. Still, that is a just a minor nit. This one is quite good.', '2004-07-11 16:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(806088, 89307, 1570, '<td valign="top">you mean, just say no and photograph the flowers? i am not exactly getting what you are selling here, but the picture itself is nice... 7.</td>', 'you mean, just say no and photograph the flowers? i am not exactly getting what you are selling here, but the picture itself is nice... 7.', '2004-07-11 16:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(806090, 89267, 7322, '<td valign="top">Weird but effective. Condom ads and public service announcements for AIDS/STD prevention are frequently rather odd so this works for me.</td>', 'Weird but effective. Condom ads and public service announcements for AIDS/STD prevention are frequently rather odd so this works for me.', '2004-07-11 16:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(806092, 89292, 1570, '<td valign="top">that''s a very good ad, 8.</td>', 'that''s a very good ad, 8.', '2004-07-11 16:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(806093, 88210, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I think the background is lava rock but I could be way off. I like that idea of the extremes in textures (yet gold comes from a rock of sorts so it is a fitting kind of background). But it isn''t quite clear from this photo. It might just be a black towel, which I don''t like. There could be a teeny bit more light on the lower petal to the immediate left of the frame. The shadow is good for developing the form but it is bit too dark and actually cuts off some of the form.</td>', 'Very nice. I think the background is lava rock but I could be way off. I like that idea of the extremes in textures (yet gold comes from a rock of sorts so it is a fitting kind of background). But it isn''t quite clear from this photo. It might just be a black towel, which I don''t like. There could be a teeny bit more light on the lower petal to the immediate left of the frame. The shadow is good for developing the form but it is bit too dark and actually cuts off some of the form.', '2004-07-11 16:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(806095, 89232, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I think we should actually be able to see some coffe in the can, as well. The composition is a bit more tilted from above then I would like. It gives the appearance that the objects are in danger of sliding off the lower edge of the frame.</td>', 'Very nice. I think we should actually be able to see some coffe in the can, as well. The composition is a bit more tilted from above then I would like. It gives the appearance that the objects are in danger of sliding off the lower edge of the frame.', '2004-07-11 16:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(806097, 87333, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The lighting is a bit blown out at the bottom but they may be intentional. I would like to see a bit less wrinkling on the label but that may have been hard to prevent. Overall, one of the better I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Very nice. The lighting is a bit blown out at the bottom but they may be intentional. I would like to see a bit less wrinkling on the label but that may have been hard to prevent. Overall, one of the better I''ve seen so far.', '2004-07-11 16:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(806098, 89178, 15575, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but without the title, I don''t think it would be ''advertising'' anything</td>', 'Nice photo, but without the title, I don''t think it would be ''advertising'' anything', '2004-07-11 16:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(806099, 88384, 7322, '<td valign="top">The focus is too soft, exposure is too dark, and the black and white rather dull. To achieve good results with black and white takes a bit more than desaturating the image.</td>', 'The focus is too soft, exposure is too dark, and the black and white rather dull. To achieve good results with black and white takes a bit more than desaturating the image.', '2004-07-11 16:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(806102, 89343, 7322, '<td valign="top">Not bad. The lighting is good and the product is clearly visible with only one distraction. I don''t understand the choice of background. The wood planking doesn''t say much about the product so it appears to be a random choice.</td>', 'Not bad. The lighting is good and the product is clearly visible with only one distraction. I don''t understand the choice of background. The wood planking doesn''t say much about the product so it appears to be a random choice.', '2004-07-11 16:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(806103, 89216, 7322, '<td valign="top">Haha. Not bad. The lighting is good (except for the shadow under the hammer and the ''new &amp; improved lettering). I had to tilt my head to read the label on the hammer so I would say that touch was just gilding the lily.</td>', 'Haha. Not bad. The lighting is good (except for the shadow under the hammer and the ''new & improved lettering). I had to tilt my head to read the label on the hammer so I would say that touch was just gilding the lily.', '2004-07-11 16:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(806104, 88821, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I can''t quite figure out what the metal ring and black stuff is under the lens. Am I missing something?</td>', 'Interesting. I can''t quite figure out what the metal ring and black stuff is under the lens. Am I missing something?', '2004-07-11 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(806107, 88189, 7322, '<td valign="top">It looks like you may have been sampling some of the product because this is not in focus. I am seeing double and I haven''t been drinking anything stronger than coffee. <br/> <br/>I suggest a tripod next time.</td>', 'It looks like you may have been sampling some of the product because this is not in focus. I am seeing double and I haven''t been drinking anything stronger than coffee.  I suggest a tripod next time.', '2004-07-11 16:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(806108, 87636, 15575, '<td valign="top">Background lighting could be better/more interesting...a garden veg patch maybe?  But I like the idea</td>', 'Background lighting could be better/more interesting...a garden veg patch maybe?  But I like the idea', '2004-07-11 16:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(806109, 89176, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a decent composition with good use of available light. It really doesn''t say ''advertisement'' to me, though. I can''t see this being an ad for Time magazine. It doesn''t say anything about the product. <br/>It says more about the magazine holder.</td>', 'This is a decent composition with good use of available light. It really doesn''t say ''advertisement'' to me, though. I can''t see this being an ad for Time magazine. It doesn''t say anything about the product. It says more about the magazine holder.', '2004-07-11 16:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(806110, 89340, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and nice composition. The lighting is good, the product is prominent and the message is clear. You''ve even left room at the right for text. Very nice.</td>', 'Interesting idea and nice composition. The lighting is good, the product is prominent and the message is clear. You''ve even left room at the right for text. Very nice.', '2004-07-11 16:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(806112, 89047, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The focus on the processor is a bit fuzzy or perhaps just noisy from compression. I think this is just too busy for an advertisment.</td>', 'Interesting. The focus on the processor is a bit fuzzy or perhaps just noisy from compression. I think this is just too busy for an advertisment.', '2004-07-11 16:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(806113, 89292, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the analogy. It''s not in common parliance so it''s kind of off for me. It''s a fun shot of the dog but I shouldn''t be seeing the debris on the pool cover which is presumably the product. It really doesn''t say ''advertisment'' to me. Original entry, though. <br/> <br/>On a non-DPC note, I must say it''s gratifying to see someone taking this sensible approach to safe pool ownership. In Rhode Island, a local soldier, stationed in Iraq, had to return home last week because his toddler drowned in the family swimming pool. A cover like this would have prevented that tragedy.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the analogy. It''s not in common parliance so it''s kind of off for me. It''s a fun shot of the dog but I shouldn''t be seeing the debris on the pool cover which is presumably the product. It really doesn''t say ''advertisment'' to me. Original entry, though.  On a non-DPC note, I must say it''s gratifying to see someone taking this sensible approach to safe pool ownership. In Rhode Island, a local soldier, stationed in Iraq, had to return home last week because his toddler drowned in the family swimming pool. A cover like this would have prevented that tragedy.', '2004-07-11 16:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(806115, 88837, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice. I somehow feel I should be able to read Yamha somehwere on the bike but I don''t look at car/motorcycle magazines so perhaps not.</td>', 'Nice. I somehow feel I should be able to read Yamha somehwere on the bike but I don''t look at car/motorcycle magazines so perhaps not.', '2004-07-11 16:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(806116, 89063, 7322, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea. However, the greenery in the background rather belies the wording of the ''ad''.</td>', 'An interesting idea. However, the greenery in the background rather belies the wording of the ''ad''.', '2004-07-11 16:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(806119, 89293, 7322, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the product label clearly. I don''t understand the choice to crop the bottom of the glass. This is not a great liquid shot. The water looks murky and unappetizing. This is quite overexposed. The blown-out bottle almost disappears into the blown-out sky.</td>', 'I can''t see the product label clearly. I don''t understand the choice to crop the bottom of the glass. This is not a great liquid shot. The water looks murky and unappetizing. This is quite overexposed. The blown-out bottle almost disappears into the blown-out sky.', '2004-07-11 16:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(806121, 89243, 7322, '<td valign="top">Brownies should look much tastier than this. This looks rather yucky and unappealing. The fork seems to be the main subject which is not good for advertising. The viewer should be able to see the entire label of the product. The composition is just weird. After viewing it for a couple of minutes, I''ve only just realized that the fork is poking into a hole in the box. This foreshortened view was a bad choice. The cropping is far too narrow. The image itself is too small. Next time, take advantage of the 640 maximum DPC allows.</td>', 'Brownies should look much tastier than this. This looks rather yucky and unappealing. The fork seems to be the main subject which is not good for advertising. The viewer should be able to see the entire label of the product. The composition is just weird. After viewing it for a couple of minutes, I''ve only just realized that the fork is poking into a hole in the box. This foreshortened view was a bad choice. The cropping is far too narrow. The image itself is too small. Next time, take advantage of the 640 maximum DPC allows.', '2004-07-11 17:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(806124, 89289, 7322, '<td valign="top">It looks like you set this up in front of your dishwasher or some other big appliance. Not a great choice for a background. I don''t understand the choice to show two boxes. The box on the left is just more business in an already busy composition. A single (REAL) flower, the suds, soap, and one box would have been much more effective. The swans and silk flower arrangement are just kind of cheesy looking. After viewing it for awhile, a finally get that the background I''m seeing is the bathroom tile and the lower edge of a mirror. I was seeing the mirror as a chrome handle on an appliance. <br/> <br/>Next time, create a still-life on a table against a simple background (matte white paper or poster board) with only the product and one or two other items (like flowers, petals, etc.).</td>', 'It looks like you set this up in front of your dishwasher or some other big appliance. Not a great choice for a background. I don''t understand the choice to show two boxes. The box on the left is just more business in an already busy composition. A single (REAL) flower, the suds, soap, and one box would have been much more effective. The swans and silk flower arrangement are just kind of cheesy looking. After viewing it for awhile, a finally get that the background I''m seeing is the bathroom tile and the lower edge of a mirror. I was seeing the mirror as a chrome handle on an appliance.  Next time, create a still-life on a table against a simple background (matte white paper or poster board) with only the product and one or two other items (like flowers, petals, etc.).', '2004-07-11 17:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(806126, 88087, 7322, '<td valign="top">This seems rather derrogatory for advertisement. A surplus suggests people aren''t buying the product. It''s a rather random looking composition although kind of interesting in a weird way.</td>', 'This seems rather derrogatory for advertisement. A surplus suggests people aren''t buying the product. It''s a rather random looking composition although kind of interesting in a weird way.', '2004-07-11 17:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(806129, 88255, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the transparent area over the lens. Is that a lens cover or is it a blurred effect showing the lens zooming? I don''t know enough about the product to tell. The lighting is good and the product is prominently, if rather uninterestingly, displayed.</td>', 'I don''t understand the transparent area over the lens. Is that a lens cover or is it a blurred effect showing the lens zooming? I don''t know enough about the product to tell. The lighting is good and the product is prominently, if rather uninterestingly, displayed.', '2004-07-11 17:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(806130, 88213, 7322, '<td valign="top">As the text referring to the clover (one source of honey) or the bee (the only source of honey I know of)? This doesn''t really say ''advertisement'' to me since there is no actual product being displayed. In a real ad I would expect to see the honey. This photo says to me, the participant couldn''t think of anything better and entered a bee/flower photo instead.</td>', 'As the text referring to the clover (one source of honey) or the bee (the only source of honey I know of)? This doesn''t really say ''advertisement'' to me since there is no actual product being displayed. In a real ad I would expect to see the honey. This photo says to me, the participant couldn''t think of anything better and entered a bee/flower photo instead.', '2004-07-11 17:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(806132, 89184, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is way too small, for starters. You are allowed a 640 pixel maximum. I suggest you take advantage of it next time. As for the challenge, I don''t understand what is being advertised. Tourism? The blue in the clouds and the mountains looks bizarrely unreal.</td>', 'This is way too small, for starters. You are allowed a 640 pixel maximum. I suggest you take advantage of it next time. As for the challenge, I don''t understand what is being advertised. Tourism? The blue in the clouds and the mountains looks bizarrely unreal.', '2004-07-11 17:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(806135, 88675, 7322, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation ruins the outdoor feeling since we can''t see the green grass. Weird choice for this. The product is prominently displayed but in a pretty boring way. The cropping at the lower edge is too close. It looks like the laptop is falling off the edge of the frame.</td>', 'The selective desaturation ruins the outdoor feeling since we can''t see the green grass. Weird choice for this. The product is prominently displayed but in a pretty boring way. The cropping at the lower edge is too close. It looks like the laptop is falling off the edge of the frame.', '2004-07-11 17:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(806138, 87970, 7322, '<td valign="top">In terms of your ''ad copy'', I think there is an ESL difficulty. That kind of ruins the advertisement qualityt of this photo, which didn''t have much to begin with. <br/> <br/>Photographically, it is a bit high contrast. There are very few middle values.</td>', 'In terms of your ''ad copy'', I think there is an ESL difficulty. That kind of ruins the advertisement qualityt of this photo, which didn''t have much to begin with.  Photographically, it is a bit high contrast. There are very few middle values.', '2004-07-11 17:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(806140, 88593, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. It is quite a bit overexposed. I suggest next time you need to shoot something outdoors like this, you bring along something to diffuse the light a bit (a white umbrella, a sheer white curtain, something along those lines).  The cropping is a bit tight at the bottom. There should be a little space in front of the product. Also, the bottle is tilted quite a bit. Nice effort.</td>', 'Nice idea. It is quite a bit overexposed. I suggest next time you need to shoot something outdoors like this, you bring along something to diffuse the light a bit (a white umbrella, a sheer white curtain, something along those lines).  The cropping is a bit tight at the bottom. There should be a little space in front of the product. Also, the bottle is tilted quite a bit. Nice effort.', '2004-07-11 17:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(806145, 88246, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice try. It doesn''t really say ''advertisement'' to me.  <br/> <br/>Photographically, it''s a bit too contrasty. The building has potential for interesting subject matter but this is a very literal portrayal. The overhead lighting and the scrubby trees in the background detract from any drama this might have.</td>', 'Nice try. It doesn''t really say ''advertisement'' to me.   Photographically, it''s a bit too contrasty. The building has potential for interesting subject matter but this is a very literal portrayal. The overhead lighting and the scrubby trees in the background detract from any drama this might have.', '2004-07-11 17:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(806154, 89228, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see the advertisment quality. For one thing, I don''t know what is being advertised. Generic candles? <br/> <br/>The partial text on the middle candle confuses things further. This is rather dull subject matter. The somewhat diagonal line created by the row of candles leads the eye to nowhere but the blown out white background.</td>', 'I don''t really see the advertisment quality. For one thing, I don''t know what is being advertised. Generic candles?  The partial text on the middle candle confuses things further. This is rather dull subject matter. The somewhat diagonal line created by the row of candles leads the eye to nowhere but the blown out white background.', '2004-07-11 17:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(806155, 89230, 24021, '<td valign="top">Ugh, doesn''t make me want to visit.  :-)</td>', 'Ugh, doesn''t make me want to visit.  :-)', '2004-07-11 17:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(806166, 86860, 7322, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really say ''advertisement'' to me unless it is an anti-smoking public service announcement. Since your heading suggests otherwise, I have to evaluate it as an actual ad for cigarettes. It doesn''t work as an ad because the guy is squinty and unappealing. He doesn''t appear to be enjoying himself. In other words, he does not make smoking look appealing.<br/> <br/>Photographically, it is a kind of random looking snap shot with nothing of real interest to absorb the viewer. The background is messy and distracting. The focus isn''t too sharp. It is very high contrast. <br/> <br/></td>', 'This doesn''t really say ''advertisement'' to me unless it is an anti-smoking public service announcement. Since your heading suggests otherwise, I have to evaluate it as an actual ad for cigarettes. It doesn''t work as an ad because the guy is squinty and unappealing. He doesn''t appear to be enjoying himself. In other words, he does not make smoking look appealing. Photographically, it is a kind of random looking snap shot with nothing of real interest to absorb the viewer. The background is messy and distracting. The focus isn''t too sharp. It is very high contrast.  ', '2004-07-11 17:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(806167, 89170, 15407, '<td valign="top">If your phone service provider has a strong signal at this location (I''m guessing California in the Sierras) please let me know who it is!  If I go out of the metropolitan areas in California my signal goes away...  and the only reason I need a cell phone is for emergencies!  This photo ''nails'' the theme of the challenge "Your job is to photograph a product and have it appeal to your audience: the users of DPChallenge." and is a GREAT photo to boot - 9</td>', 'If your phone service provider has a strong signal at this location (I''m guessing California in the Sierras) please let me know who it is!  If I go out of the metropolitan areas in California my signal goes away...  and the only reason I need a cell phone is for emergencies!  This photo ''nails'' the theme of the challenge "Your job is to photograph a product and have it appeal to your audience: the users of DPChallenge." and is a GREAT photo to boot - 9', '2004-07-11 17:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(806168, 89309, 15407, '<td valign="top">THat would be a ''cruncy'' bite! looks almost good enough to eat!</td>', 'THat would be a ''cruncy'' bite! looks almost good enough to eat!', '2004-07-11 17:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(806169, 88242, 24021, '<td valign="top">I like the red background seemingly bursting from the can.  Neat effect.</td>', 'I like the red background seemingly bursting from the can.  Neat effect.', '2004-07-11 17:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(806170, 89339, 24021, '<td valign="top">Blurry and bland.</td>', 'Blurry and bland.', '2004-07-11 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(806178, 88424, 15407, '<td valign="top">The slow shutter made the waterfall look just right for me; as such it suggests the smoothness of the Scotch.  Basic editing kept you from making this an Excellent image as the flash highlights could have been cooled down otherwise. One of my favorites!</td>', 'The slow shutter made the waterfall look just right for me; as such it suggests the smoothness of the Scotch.  Basic editing kept you from making this an Excellent image as the flash highlights could have been cooled down otherwise. One of my favorites!', '2004-07-11 17:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(806182, 88817, 15407, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I know nothing about this cameras capabilities so you may have been able to create titles within the camera and not add the text later, Ill vote it as legal and give it one of my highest votes.</td>', 'This is great!  I know nothing about this cameras capabilities so you may have been able to create titles within the camera and not add the text later, Ill vote it as legal and give it one of my highest votes.', '2004-07-11 18:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(806241, 89046, 23373, '<td valign="top">Fresh perspective.</td>', 'Fresh perspective.', '2004-07-11 19:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(806243, 89285, 23373, '<td valign="top">Love the color and highlights</td>', 'Love the color and highlights', '2004-07-11 19:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(806245, 88932, 23373, '<td valign="top">Wish  it was a little sharper</td>', 'Wish  it was a little sharper', '2004-07-11 19:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(806248, 88132, 23373, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color, like the reflection. Have you considered a little additional background on the left and a bit less on the right side still keeping the subjet off center.  Also how would this look with greater sharpness on the face of the watch without loosing the drop off on the DOF on the back of the band.</td>', 'Wonderful color, like the reflection. Have you considered a little additional background on the left and a bit less on the right side still keeping the subjet off center.  Also how would this look with greater sharpness on the face of the watch without loosing the drop off on the DOF on the back of the band.', '2004-07-11 19:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(806249, 89266, 23373, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2004-07-11 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(806250, 88125, 23373, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective - very creative.</td>', 'Like the perspective - very creative.', '2004-07-11 19:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(806252, 88255, 23373, '<td valign="top">I asume you have the lens moving during the photo - great idea</td>', 'I asume you have the lens moving during the photo - great idea', '2004-07-11 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(806254, 88339, 23373, '<td valign="top">Very fun - you got a big laugh out of me, thanks.</td>', 'Very fun - you got a big laugh out of me, thanks.', '2004-07-11 19:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(806256, 89349, 23373, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Wish the lighting was different.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Wish the lighting was different.', '2004-07-11 19:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(806258, 89167, 23373, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little hot?</td>', 'Perhaps a little hot?', '2004-07-11 19:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(806261, 88425, 23373, '<td valign="top">Great crop, great color - very cute.</td>', 'Great crop, great color - very cute.', '2004-07-11 19:28:21.000000', NULL, 1);
