(806301, 88657, 20214, '<td valign="top">Very cute! nice photo. 10</td>', 'Very cute! nice photo. 10', '2004-07-11 20:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(806303, 88890, 21714, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked much better in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I think this would have worked much better in B&W.', '2004-07-11 20:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(806305, 89308, 20214, '<td valign="top">Might have been more effective with the cute baby in focus. JMO</td>', 'Might have been more effective with the cute baby in focus. JMO', '2004-07-11 20:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(806387, 88894, 16957, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture with clear thought given to lighting which is key to an editorial shoot. Personally I find the background a bit odd and IMO the feathers distract a lot from the image. If they were Red Grouse dfeathers that might be different! Still an excellent shot. 9</td>', 'Beautiful capture with clear thought given to lighting which is key to an editorial shoot. Personally I find the background a bit odd and IMO the feathers distract a lot from the image. If they were Red Grouse dfeathers that might be different! Still an excellent shot. 9', '2004-07-11 21:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(806389, 89340, 16957, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured with a real editorial feel. 10</td>', 'Beautifully captured with a real editorial feel. 10', '2004-07-11 21:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(806427, 89279, 22385, '<td valign="top">Way too dark.... can barely see the camera.  Good close-up angle, though.</td>', 'Way too dark.... can barely see the camera.  Good close-up angle, though.', '2004-07-11 22:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(806431, 88412, 22922, '<td valign="top">It seems like you should have all the flavors if you''re going to do this.  Why three citron?  Anyway, the idea and compositions are very nice, I like the arrangement of the bottles.  The venetian blinds are iffy for me, but I can see how they give an interesting lighting effect.  Focus is sharp, good DOF.</td>', 'It seems like you should have all the flavors if you''re going to do this.  Why three citron?  Anyway, the idea and compositions are very nice, I like the arrangement of the bottles.  The venetian blinds are iffy for me, but I can see how they give an interesting lighting effect.  Focus is sharp, good DOF.', '2004-07-11 22:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(806435, 88184, 22922, '<td valign="top">The idea here is interesting, you seem to have over edited a bit, though.  The hand is nice and sharp, very good detail, and the pose is a good leader into the center of the frame.  The phonebook, unfortunately, is terribly washed out, I wouldn''t know what it was without your title.  The background is very odd, did you overuse the sharpening tools? There seem to be fuzzy trees with sharp edges, and some of the effect even occurs on the hand.  Could also be due to overusing levels.  I think you propably have a very strong original, try re-editing to show us that strength.</td>', 'The idea here is interesting, you seem to have over edited a bit, though.  The hand is nice and sharp, very good detail, and the pose is a good leader into the center of the frame.  The phonebook, unfortunately, is terribly washed out, I wouldn''t know what it was without your title.  The background is very odd, did you overuse the sharpening tools? There seem to be fuzzy trees with sharp edges, and some of the effect even occurs on the hand.  Could also be due to overusing levels.  I think you propably have a very strong original, try re-editing to show us that strength.', '2004-07-11 22:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(806438, 89052, 22922, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it, but that doesn''t make it a bad picture.  Nice image, probably a good ad for the target market :) A little bit of graininess.</td>', 'I don''t get it, but that doesn''t make it a bad picture.  Nice image, probably a good ad for the target market :) A little bit of graininess.', '2004-07-11 22:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(806445, 89170, 22922, '<td valign="top">I know everyone hates comments on content, but when I looked at this shot, I thought "Wouldn''t it be funny if there were someone (or several someones) in the water in the background?"  I think the hint of innuendo might add to the draw of the brand.  The idea of being in the middle of nowhere comes across, but what about being somewhere so far that noone will see you?  Maybe a pile of clothes next to the phone would give the same effect :)  Anyway, I like the image, I thought at first that the phone should be larger, but I like it now, it really works.</td>', 'I know everyone hates comments on content, but when I looked at this shot, I thought "Wouldn''t it be funny if there were someone (or several someones) in the water in the background?"  I think the hint of innuendo might add to the draw of the brand.  The idea of being in the middle of nowhere comes across, but what about being somewhere so far that noone will see you?  Maybe a pile of clothes next to the phone would give the same effect :)  Anyway, I like the image, I thought at first that the phone should be larger, but I like it now, it really works.', '2004-07-11 22:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(806446, 88935, 22922, '<td valign="top">This looks like an ad straight out of some 70''s cooking magazine :)  Something about the coloring, composition and setting says old-fashioned.  Nice ad.</td>', 'This looks like an ad straight out of some 70''s cooking magazine :)  Something about the coloring, composition and setting says old-fashioned.  Nice ad.', '2004-07-11 22:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(806449, 89251, 22922, '<td valign="top">What''s with the expression?  Not sure what this ad is supposed to say, right now it doesn''t really draw me in at all.  The picture is focused and centered, but nothing very exciting.</td>', 'What''s with the expression?  Not sure what this ad is supposed to say, right now it doesn''t really draw me in at all.  The picture is focused and centered, but nothing very exciting.', '2004-07-11 22:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(806454, 89173, 22922, '<td valign="top">Huh?  What are you advertising?  Sorry, I just have no idea what you mean here.  The photo is ok, looks like a stock photo of a boat. Interesting oil slick (?) on the water.</td>', 'Huh?  What are you advertising?  Sorry, I just have no idea what you mean here.  The photo is ok, looks like a stock photo of a boat. Interesting oil slick (?) on the water.', '2004-07-11 22:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(806457, 89312, 22922, '<td valign="top">I think if you cropped to just above the top of the grey wall, this photo would work alot better.  I like the idea and composition, not sure what the product is, since the car is not in focus and the remote is not focused enough to read a brand name.  Semi-successful ad.</td>', 'I think if you cropped to just above the top of the grey wall, this photo would work alot better.  I like the idea and composition, not sure what the product is, since the car is not in focus and the remote is not focused enough to read a brand name.  Semi-successful ad.', '2004-07-11 22:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
