(806980, 88294, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice car, background and everything - that stupid line in the middle of the photo ruins it. (Is this YOUR car?)</td>', 'Nice car, background and everything - that stupid line in the middle of the photo ruins it. (Is this YOUR car?)', '2004-07-12 04:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
