(807018, 88837, 22011, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for a bike shot... :-).  Th eone niggle I have iwth this is the focus on the bike seems a little soft, and the big lump of grass sticking up in front of the front tyre.  In a ''real'' bike add the helment also probably wouldn''t be on the handlebar, but that''s being really picky.  Nice machine, well taken...  (I also own a yamaha..)</td>', 'I''m a sucker for a bike shot... :-).  Th eone niggle I have iwth this is the focus on the bike seems a little soft, and the big lump of grass sticking up in front of the front tyre.  In a ''real'' bike add the helment also probably wouldn''t be on the handlebar, but that''s being really picky.  Nice machine, well taken...  (I also own a yamaha..)', '2004-07-12 06:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
