(809115, 88413, 18512, '<td valign="top">Original and well observed. Nice composition. Maybe some more contrast and saturation would have improved the impression. Anyway, - I like it!</td>', 'Original and well observed. Nice composition. Maybe some more contrast and saturation would have improved the impression. Anyway, - I like it!', '2004-07-13 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
