(809764, 88424, 8860, '<td valign="top">Ooh yeah - nice. Does the job for me. Slight flash glare on bottle is my only crit, but it''s memorable.</td>', 'Ooh yeah - nice. Does the job for me. Slight flash glare on bottle is my only crit, but it''s memorable.', '2004-07-13 21:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
