(809787, 89047, 19944, '<td valign="top">It''s what''s inside that counts?  Then that PC doesn''t count for much.  A 200mhz Pentium?!?   Oh, but it is MMX.  Nice pictures.  Great colors.</td>', 'It''s what''s inside that counts?  Then that PC doesn''t count for much.  A 200mhz Pentium?!?   Oh, but it is MMX.  Nice pictures.  Great colors.', '2004-07-13 21:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
