(810140, 89312, 3649, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the comments. i''m terribly surprised how many really low votes this got, but i also recognize the major flaws (background, focus, i guess my color treatment didn''t help)... that''s what I get for a last-day shoot.<br/> <br/>I wish I could claim credit for the idea. I wish I could have executed it better. Live and learn.<br/> <br/>The original (award-winning) idea belongs to this crew, for their series of magazine ads:<br/>  Olaf Veltman, photographer<br/>  Rob Ranew, art director<br/>  McKinney &amp; Silver, ad agency<br/>  Audi, client</td>', 'thanks for all the comments. i''m terribly surprised how many really low votes this got, but i also recognize the major flaws (background, focus, i guess my color treatment didn''t help)... that''s what I get for a last-day shoot. I wish I could claim credit for the idea. I wish I could have executed it better. Live and learn. The original (award-winning) idea belongs to this crew, for their series of magazine ads:  Olaf Veltman, photographer  Rob Ranew, art director  McKinney & Silver, ad agency  Audi, client', '2004-07-14 01:07:37.000000', NULL, 0),
