(810148, 88898, 22734, '<td valign="top">This was made to pay tribure to Ansel Adams who invented the Zone System. Since many of his shots were done with a view camera, I placed one in background and place the product atop the film folders. So as to tease the viewer I selected a shallow dof, which bothered some people. As a matter of fact, some did not even know that it was a view camera in the background and the plate holders were a also a mystery. Some even asked me what the Zone System is.<br/>  However, I presented this more as a novelty and to overcome all the 3 ones, 7 twos, 21 threes and 29 fours, and still come out in 30th place, I am happy with the image.</td>', 'This was made to pay tribure to Ansel Adams who invented the Zone System. Since many of his shots were done with a view camera, I placed one in background and place the product atop the film folders. So as to tease the viewer I selected a shallow dof, which bothered some people. As a matter of fact, some did not even know that it was a view camera in the background and the plate holders were a also a mystery. Some even asked me what the Zone System is.  However, I presented this more as a novelty and to overcome all the 3 ones, 7 twos, 21 threes and 29 fours, and still come out in 30th place, I am happy with the image.', '2004-07-14 01:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
