(1037508, 89166, 23161, '<td valign="top">photo was taken BEFORE I saw the competition and so I worked kinda backwards<br/></td>', 'photo was taken BEFORE I saw the competition and so I worked kinda backwards', '2004-11-30 02:45:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1057714, 88876, 6900, '<td valign="top">I think the most important issue in an advertisement is to get the product in.  Clearly you have a good idea here, but I don''t think there''s enough product here.  I see "pet food only" but I still don''t know what a Schmacko is.<br/> <br/>The light looks a little flash-y to me.  I don''t like on camera flash, so I use available light whenever possible - putting the dog by a window or something. :)<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'I think the most important issue in an advertisement is to get the product in.  Clearly you have a good idea here, but I don''t think there''s enough product here.  I see "pet food only" but I still don''t know what a Schmacko is. The light looks a little flash-y to me.  I don''t like on camera flash, so I use available light whenever possible - putting the dog by a window or something. :) M', '2004-12-11 22:05:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1195972, 88198, 5286, '<td valign="top">very very sharp, these creatures are not so easy to get so sharp! it''s beautifully composed, only since it''s so sharp it makes me wish there were a tighter crop so i could see more detailed in the constrained 640 pixel size... beautiful work!!</td>', 'very very sharp, these creatures are not so easy to get so sharp! it''s beautifully composed, only since it''s so sharp it makes me wish there were a tighter crop so i could see more detailed in the constrained 640 pixel size... beautiful work!!', '2005-02-26 16:48:56.000000', NULL, 0);
